le, organized and truthful. Suddenly, she had become politically radioactive.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Boyfriend as a Liability in City Hall', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Boyfriend as a Liability in City Hall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dwyer, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Noerdlinger, Rachel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Lis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T00:56:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Dwyer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dwyer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6e5f286d-d3d8-5e74-8eb1-8765248110cf', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e5f286d-d3d8-5e74-8eb1-8765248110cf'}, {'abstract': 'David Boies, the plaintiff’s star lawyer, sought to paint the rescue as one that was filled with second-guessing on the part of the government.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/09/30/lawyer-tries-to-paint-a-fed-in-discord-in-a-i-g-bailout/', 'snippet': 'David Boies, the plaintiff’s star lawyer, sought to paint the rescue as one that was filled with second-guessing on the part of the government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The $40 billion lawsuit putting the taxpayer rescue of the American International Group on trial continued on Tuesday as David Boies, the plaintiff’s star lawyer, sought to paint t