expands-the-living-wage.html', 'snippet': 'The executive order signed by the mayor that raises the city’s wage to $13.13 an hour is a step toward getting the fortunes of some working-class New Yorkers to inch forward.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It isn’t radical or comprehensive, and it’s way overdue, but at least it’s a step to get the fortunes of some working-class New Yorkers inching forward instead of back. An executive order signed by Mayor Bill de Blasio on Tuesday will greatly expand the number of people covered by the city’s living-wage law, and raise that wage to $13.13 an hour from $11.90. This promises to put much-needed cash into many deserving pockets and to bolster the principle that someone who works hard in a full-time job should at least be able to cover food and rent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. de Blasio Expands the Living Wage', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. de Blasio Expands the Living Wage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Living Wage', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minimum Wage', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Orders and Memorandums', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T01:14:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/884e26f0-6879-594d-adc0-c388e7248246', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/884e26f0-6879-594d-adc0-c388e7248246'}, {'abstract': 'The punishment has raised the fear that new lines are being drawn between loyalty and treason.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/world/middleeast/kuwait-fighting-dissent-from-within-uses-citizenship-as-a-weapon-.html', 'snippet': 'The punishment has raised the fear that new lines are being drawn between loyalty and treason.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KUWAIT CITY — Moving to grind out political dissent at home while the world’s attention is focused on fighting militant extremists in Iraq and Syria, the government of Kuwait is increasingly wielding a penalty that was once rare here: revoking citizenship.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kuwait, Fighting Dissent From Within, Revokes Citizenship', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kuwait, Fighting Dissent From Within, Uses Citizenship as a Weapon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kuwait', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Citizenship and Naturalization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Human Rights Watch', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bahrain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kuwait City (Kuwait)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T01:15:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27e93c3e-9417-547b-8534-792ca5c13081', 'word_count': 1158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27e93c3e-9417-547b-8534-792ca5c13081'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Lambrecht, who sold hundreds, maybe thousands, of cars and trucks in his career, had an eccentricity or two built into his business plan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/business/ray-lambrecht-collector-of-chevrolets-is-dead-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lambrecht, who sold hundreds, maybe thousands, of cars and trucks in his career, had an eccentricity or two built into his business plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ray Lambrecht, a small-town Chevrolet dealer who became far better known for the cars he kept than the ones he sold, died on Sept. 22 at his home in Pierce, Neb., across the street from the auto dealership he owned and operated for 50 years. He was 96.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/business/LAMBRECHT-1-obit/LAMBRECHT-1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ray Lambrecht, Dealer Who Held Onto 500 Chevrolets, Is Dead at 96', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ray Lambrecht, 96, Collector of Chevrolets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weber, Bruce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lambrecht, Ray (1918-2014)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T01:20:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/03c8bd9f-89fe-5ede-a423-18e354ae2cd7', 'word_count': 701, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03c8bd9f-89fe-5ede-a423-18e354ae2cd7'}, {'abstract': 'A letter from the European Commission that suggests that Ireland gave Apple favorable treatment is yet another document that sheds light on corporate tax avoidance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/opinion/apples-special-irish-tax-breaks.html', 'snippet': 'A letter from the European Commission that suggests that Ireland gave Apple favorable treatment is yet another document that sheds light on corporate tax avoidance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There seems to be no end to the resourcefulness of multinational companies when it comes to minimizing taxes — or of countries that help them do so. The latest evidence is a preliminary finding by the European Commission that Ireland provided extravagant tax benefits to Apple that appear to have allowed the company to reduce its tax liability, possibly by billions of dollars since 1991.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple’s Special Irish Tax Breaks', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Apple’s Special Irish Tax Breaks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ireland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Shelters', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hewlett-Packard Company', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Almunia, Joaquin', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T01:20:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b02d4788-99ea-5334-90b4-d37afe1ff8c1', 'word_count': 498, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b02d4788-99ea-5334-90b4-d37afe1ff8c1'}, {'abstract': 'Michigan acknowledged allowing Shane Morris to briefly return to the field with a “probable mild concussion,” highlighting a quirk of Coach Brady Hoke’s: He does not regularly wear a headset.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/sports/ncaafootball/michigan-coach-brady-hoke-shane-morris-concussion-dave-brandon.html', 'snippet': 'Michigan acknowledged allowing Shane Morris to briefly return to the field with a “probable mild concussion,” highlighting a quirk of Coach Brady Hoke’s: He does not regularly wear a headset.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANN ARBOR, Mich. — The University of Michigan acknowledged Tuesday that allowing quarterback Shane Morris to briefly return to the field after he sustained a “probable mild concussion” from a violent hit during a loss to Minnesota on Saturday was the result of a communication breakdown on the Wolverines’ sideline. The episode has highlighted a quirk of Coach Brady Hoke that has taken on a more serious resonance since Saturday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/sports/MICHIGAN1/MICHIGAN1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/sports/MICHIGAN1/MICHIGAN1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/sports/MICHIGAN1/MICHIGAN1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/s