4d733dc4596'}, {'abstract': 'Meals for one that affirm the pleasures of our own company.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/05/magazine/elevating-dinner-for-one.html', 'snippet': 'Meals for one that affirm the pleasures of our own company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a happy life, Montaigne wrote, we “should set aside a room, just for ourselves, at the back of the shop” — a refuge, mental if not physical, where our liberty is ours alone and our conversation inward. I like to think he meant us to include a carefully laid dinner table in the room’s shaded corner, considering how thoroughly our useful exercise of freedom relies on our being well fed.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/mag-05eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 541, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/mag-05eat-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 541}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/mag-05eat-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 924, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/mag-05eat-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1847, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/05/magazine/05eat/05eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0,