e': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/87ba265f-4ccc-51e5-b701-e83e879e212b', 'word_count': 1028, 'uri': 'nyt://article/87ba265f-4ccc-51e5-b701-e83e879e212b'}, {'abstract': 'The founders aren’t sure how much demand will rise, but they want to be ready if the product takes off.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/can-a-two-person-company-ramp-up-for-the-holidays/', 'snippet': 'The founders aren’t sure how much demand will rise, but they want to be ready if the product takes off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We just published a case study about a new company trying to decide how to increase production in anticipation of growing holiday sales, and how to pay for it. The founders aren’t sure how much demand will rise, but they want to be ready if the product takes off.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can a Two-Person Company Ramp Up for the Holidays?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T17:42:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Weed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ae22639-c8cc-5c49-b960-1d42f3d5ec2a', 'word_count': 553, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ae22639-c8cc-5c49-b960-1d42f3d5ec2a'}, {'abstract': 'Among wealthy colleges, Chicago enrolls relatively few lower-income studen