a0-b792-e018c3dfc169'}, {'abstract': 'A Hungarian musicologist finds Mozart’s own score of the Piano Sonata in A, K. 331.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/01/a-mozart-mystery-sonata-manuscript-surfaces-in-budapest/', 'snippet': 'A Hungarian musicologist finds Mozart’s own score of the Piano Sonata in A, K. 331.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Balazs Mikusi, a young Hungarian musicologist, it was the find of a lifetime. Leafing through folders of unidentified manuscripts at the National Szechenyi Library in Budapest recently, he came across four pages of what looked to him like Mozart’s handwriting. As he read through the music, he told Agence France-Presse, he realized that he had stumbled onto Mozart’s own score of the Piano Sonata in A, K.331 – one of the best-known Mozart sonatas because of its “Rondo alla Turca” finale.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mozart Mystery: Sonata Manuscript Surfaces in Budapest', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Original Mozart Score Is Found in Budapest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mikusi, Balazs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mozart, Wolfgang Amadeus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Budapest (Hungary)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-01T18:21:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca365cf1-26cc-5c8b-a180-94f45e5458c9', 'word_count': 320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca365cf1-26cc-5c8b-a180-94f45e5458c9'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Pierson failed to quell a bipartisan political furor over repeated breaches of security and lost the confidence of the president her agency is charged with protecting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/02/us/julia-pierson-secret-service.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Pierson failed to quell a bipartisan political furor over repeated breaches of security and lost the confidence of the president her agency is charged with protecting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Julia Pierson resigned under pressure as director of the Secret Service on Wednesday after failing to quell a bipartisan political furor over repeated breaches of White House security and losing the confidence of the president her agency is charged with protecting.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/02/us/SECRET/SECRET-thumbStandard.jpg', 't