c tweets demarcates new ground in the debate on academic freedom in the digital age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steven G. Salaita says the University of Illinois destroyed his career.\xa0The Palestinian-American professor was invited to\xa0teach in the university’s American Indian studies program earlier this year, but the board of trustees voted to block his\xa0appointment to the tenure-track position following “a\xa0campaign by pro-Israel\xa0students, faculty members and donors who contended that his Twitter comments on the bombardment of Gaza this summer were anti-Semitic,” according to The New York Times’s Robert Mackey. (You can read a selection of the offending tweets in Mr. Mackey’s story.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 2021, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/01/opinion/nyto-prof/nyto-prof-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 's