ating patients.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/02/some-good-news-on-pneumonia/', 'snippet': 'New vaccine recommendations should bolster protection against pneumonia, which sickens three million to four million American adults a year. Hospitals also appear to be doing a better job in treating patients.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We discuss a fair number of grim topics hereabouts, so when I hear about good news, I figure I should grab it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Some Good News on Pneumonia', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pneumonia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-02T16:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80549a87-acd5-548d-9bc0-a253f7bd84ce', 'word_count': 989, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80549a87-acd5-548d-9bc0-a253f7bd84ce'}, {'abstract': 'Michael R. Bloomberg and two Disney princesses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/02/today-in-political-throwbackthursday-bloomberg-and-two-disney-princesses/', 'snippet': 'Michael R. Bloomberg and two Disney princesses.', 'lead_paragraph': '[Photo: View on Instagram.]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Today in Political #ThrowBackThursday: Bloomberg on Ice', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 1,