tified that his agency had received a report from the State Department ‘‘that indicated this man (Oswald) a thoroughly safe risk here, he had changed his views, he was a loyal man now and had seen the light of day so to speak.’’\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 3, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 893, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 893}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 620, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 620, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/blogs/03iht-oldoct03-oswald/03iht-oldoct03-oswald-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin