ed aesthetic the director uses for the rest of the film. Here, he wanted to paint the beginnings of an affair in more melodramatic strokes, with a tracking camera, passion on windblown faces, dubbed dialogue and swelling strings in a score by Grégoire Hetzel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mathieu Amalric Narrates a Scene From ‘The Blue Room’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AMALRIC, MATHIEU', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-02T20:42:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1550dd5d-f404-5dcf-b041-38308aa9ee67', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1550dd5d-f404-5dcf-b041-38308aa9ee67'}, {'abstract': 'Mikhail B. Khodorkovsky, who once led the Yukos oil company, vows to lead a drive to counter Putinism but has not yet dared to return to Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/world/europe/mikhail-khodorkovsky-ex-oil-tycoon-plans-to-lead-political-movement.html', 'snippet': 'Mikhail B. Khodorkovsky, who once led the Yukos oil company, vows to lead a drive to counter Putinism but has not yet dared to return to Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The last time he was here, Mikhail B. Khodorkovsky was an oil tycoon and Russia’s richest man in the midst of a political fight with the Kremlin. He had been warned to leave his country and stay away. But when he was done with his business in Washington, he defiantly headed home.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New Y