nyt://article/6968c282-8a2d-5a9f-96c3-19dca8a62d5b'}, {'abstract': 'As grieving families continue their demands for a full inquiry into the April disaster, the president’s supporters have started to criticize them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/world/asia/sewol-ferry-disaster-polarizes-south-korea.html', 'snippet': 'As grieving families continue their demands for a full inquiry into the April disaster, the president’s supporters have started to criticize them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — For months, the grieving parents of teenagers who drowned aboard the Sewol ferry have camped out on Seoul’s grandest boulevard, staging hunger strikes to protest what they call the government’s refusal to fully investigate the role that official incompetence and lax enforcement played in the disaster. And for months, the country mourned with them. The story of one father who subsisted for 46 days on water and salt gripped the nation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/world/FERRY/FERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/world/FERRY/FERRY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/world/FERRY/FERRY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/world/FERRY/FERRY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/world/FERRY/FERRY-