.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/nyregion/bratton-vows-to-root-out-bad-new-york-police-officers.html', 'snippet': 'Commissioner William J. Bratton told police commanders that while the vast majority of officers did their jobs well, those who did not were “not the right fit” for the department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Commissioner William J. Bratton delivered a blunt message on Thursday as he opened a conference of New York Police Department commanders: The agency’s gains against crime were being undercut by its most troublesome officers, and they had to be rooted out.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03YBRATTON/03YBRATTON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No