een distilled eroticism and raw sex, 25 of these efforts stood out in the superb James retrospective at the Metropolitan Museum of Art this spring. Now there’s an excellent, if fleeting, chance to see some more.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 842}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 730, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1459, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6/CHASJAMES-GALLERIES6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Charles James: ‘Beneath the Dress’', '