f5444-bdd6-5231-925d-4e8b29852346'}, {'abstract': '“Dance & Fashion,” an exhibition at the Museum at the Fashion Institute of Technology, charts the intersection of the two art forms, from the 1830s through the modern-dance era.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/arts/design/dance-fashion-at-fit-explores-a-magical-interweave.html', 'snippet': '“Dance & Fashion,” an exhibition at the Museum at the Fashion Institute of Technology, charts the intersection of the two art forms, from the 1830s through the modern-dance era.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most unusual thing about “Dance & Fashion,” an exhibition of almost 100 costumes and dance-influenced designs at the Museum at the Fashion Institute of Technology, is that all of the clothes are standing still. That’s what first struck me, at least, when I entered the museum’s basement gallery on a recent afternoon and scanned the brilliant, motionless display staring me down from all sides of the room.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03DANCEFIT1/03DANCEFIT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 478, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03DANCEFIT1/03DANCEFIT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 478}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03DANCEFIT1/03DANCEFIT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/arts/03DANCEFIT1/03DANCEFIT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1630, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i