ections, used a visit to his home state on Thursday to highlight the country’s economic growth and to make his case on a handful of issues that are important to Democrats in November.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Illinois Speech, Obama Trumpets Economic Success as Midterm Vote Nears', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Illinois Speech, Obama Trumpets Economic Success as Midterm Vote Nears', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Jonathan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-02T21:40:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3275454c-1a3b-5dfa-aea7-7815bb124f59', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3275454c-1a3b-5dfa-aea7-7815bb124f59'}, {'abstract': 'In “Background Materials,” Michal Samama experiments in movement and sounds with ideas of what is distant and what is not.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/arts/michal-samama-performs-at-the-chocolate-factory.html', 'snippet': 'In “Background Materials,” Michal Samama experiments in movement and sounds with ideas of what is distant and what is not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not an uncommon New York experience: You leave the city for the country, where sounds play a surreal