', 'word_count': 864, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9679dcf-29f2-54a9-ba50-25fc8475dfc2'}, {'abstract': 'The announcement coincided with the annual Muslim pilgrimage to Mecca. The report suggested precautions for travelers to Saudi Arabia to minimize risk of exposure to MERS.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/03/health/mers-virus-merits-caution-not-alarm-who-says.html', 'snippet': 'The announcement coincided with the annual Muslim pilgrimage to Mecca. The report suggested precautions for travelers to Saudi Arabia to minimize risk of exposure to MERS.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite their worries earlier this year, world health authorities say there is little reason to fear that the annual Muslim pilgrimage to Mecca in Saudi Arabia, which began Thursday, will spread the MERS virus widely around the world. But they are emphasizing that vigilance is still important.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mideast Virus MERS Merits Caution, Not Alarm, W.H.O. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mideast Virus Merits Caution, Not Alarm, W.H.O. Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeil, Donald G Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'MERS (Middle East Respiratory Syndrome)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilgrimages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mecca (Saudi Arabia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Medina (Saudi Arabia)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-03T00:07:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'origi