 de Blasio’s wife, Chirlane McCray, may not have disclosed that she lives with a boyfriend with a criminal record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'City investigators have opened an inquiry into Rachel Noerdlinger, the chief of staff to Mayor Bill de Blasio’s wife, Chirlane McCray, over her failure to disclose during a background check that she shares a home with a boyfriend whose criminal record and statements against law enforcement have become the subject of controversy, according to a person with knowledge of the matter.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1670, 'width': 1204, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/03/nyregion/03RACHEL/03RACHEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'hei