, '_id': 'nyt://article/b70d81ed-947b-511f-9a84-0a2cde1358e8', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b70d81ed-947b-511f-9a84-0a2cde1358e8'}, {'abstract': 'New books explore and celebrate New York City knishes, water towers and a mysterious spit of land off eastern Long Island.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/05/nyregion/obsessions-from-street-food-to-rooftops.html', 'snippet': 'New books explore and celebrate New York City knishes, water towers and a mysterious spit of land off eastern Long Island.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Material culture is now a serious discipline among academics, but has Laura Silver taken it too far in devoting 281 pages to the humble knish? Not if you’re looking for a whimsical, mouthwatering and edifying odyssey through New York neighborhoods and beyond.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/nyregion/05BOOKSHELF1/05BOOKSHELF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/05/nyregion/05BOOKSHELF1/05BOOKSHELF1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/nyregion/05BOOKSHELF1/05BOOKSHELF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/nyregion/05BOOKSHELF1/05BOOKSHELF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/nyregion/05BOOKSHELF1/05BOOKSHELF1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop