e all of the above — of many fashion visionaries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Designers project their personalities not only through their collections but also in their appearances at the end of their runway shows. To mark the conclusion of New York, London, Milan and Paris Fashion Weeks, we catalog the bows — some proud, some playful, some humble, some all of the above — of 34 fashion visionaries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Designers of Spring/Summer 2015 Fashion Week Take Their Bows', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'London Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Milan Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Fashion Week', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-03T19:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/548c6be7-bb5b-5552-872e-3dac3fa26148', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/548c6be7-bb5b-5552-872e-3dac3fa26148'}, {'abstract': 'New releases by Charlie Haden and Jim Hall, David Virelles, Bill Frisell, Ron Miles and Ryan Keberle & Catharsis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/05/arts/music/new-releases-by-charlie-haden-and-jim-hall-and-bill-frisell.html', 'snippet': 'New releases by Charlie Haden and Jim Hall, David Virelles, Bill Frisell, Ron Miles and Ryan Keberle & Catharsis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charlie Haden and Jim Hall', 'print_sectio