peration. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Texas Women Forced to Reassess After New Ruling on Abortions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Texas Women Forced to Reassess After New Ruling on Abortions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tillman, Laura', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eckholm, Erik', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Whole Woman's Health", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-03T20:32:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Tillman and Erik Eckholm', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tillman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eckholm', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c9b2552-a2a9-5a19-9ad6-681b823bdb2c', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c9b2552-a2a9-5a19-9ad6-681b823bdb2c'}, {'abstract': '“Quantum,” at the Fishman Space at BAM Fisher, is a duet of movement and light, a collaboration between artists and physicists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/04/arts/quantum-at-bam-fisher-mixes-movement-and-light.html', 'snippet': '“Quantum,” at the Fishman Space at BAM Fisher, is a duet of movement and light, a collaboration between artists and physicists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Artists and scientists have at least one thing in common: They dream big. ', 'print_section': 'C', '