/2014/10/05/automobiles/v8-expats-find-new-owners-in-an-ancient-land.html', 'snippet': 'Ali Hebi, a barber who lives in a small village in Israel, owns a car rarely seen in the Middle East: a 1978 Pontiac Firebird Trans Am.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHAAB, ISRAEL — In this small village in the north of Israel, roughly halfway between the Mediterranean and the Sea of Galilee, tan buildings are clustered on a terraced hillside. At the edge of town, where a lush olive grove at the foot of a sharp ridge meets a dusty paved road, there’s a car rarely seen in the Middle East: a 1978 Pontiac Firebird Trans Am.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/05/automobiles/EGO/EGO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/05/aut