c-830a-5bdc-9614-21d922120d41'}, {'abstract': 'The safety of female students is a focus at the University of Virginia after a man was linked to the recent disappearance of Hannah Graham, a student, and a killing in 2009.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/04/us/attention-grows-but-virginia-cases-show-vulnerability-of-women-on-campus.html', 'snippet': 'The safety of female students is a focus at the University of Virginia after a man was linked to the recent disappearance of Hannah Graham, a student, and a killing in 2009.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. — The urgent fliers pinned to trees and electric poles disrupt the calm in this quaint college town. They include two photos of a missing young woman, one with her smiling and freckled, the other of her in a crop top, racing down a hallway, a seeming allusion to a predator who the police say abducted her with the intent to do terrible harm.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/VIRGINIA1/VIRGINIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/04/us/VIRGINIA1/VIRGINIA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/VIRGINIA1/VIRGINIA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/VIRGINIA1/VIRGINIA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1028, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/VIRGINIA1/VIRGINIA1-thumbStandard.