nd-nzet-sguin.html', 'snippet': 'Three new or almost-new recordings of Schumann’s symphonies each offers its own rewards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Robert Schumann had been a really fine orchestrator — or if he were not the bumbler in that regard that conventional wisdom holds him to be — would his symphonies be more popular today? At the moment it is hard to see how they could be.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 1398, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/RECORDINGS/RECORDINGS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Embarrassment of Riches for Schumann Lovers ', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Embarrassment of Riches for Schumann Lovers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumann, Robert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berlin Philharmonic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Audio Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-05T21:35:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By James R. Oestreich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Oestreich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adcf7808-2aa0-5c9b-b5c3-49c12a1aa5f4', 'word_count': 951, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adcf7808-2aa0-5c9b-b5c3-49c12a1aa5f4'}, {'abstract': 'A 24-year-old German soprano who has been making waves across Europe presented an all-Hugo Wolf evening at the Park Avenue Armory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/06/arts/music/anna-lucia-richter-sings-hugo-wolfs-lieder.html', 'snippet': 'A 24-year-old German soprano who has been making waves across Europe presented an all-Hugo Wolf evening at the Park Avenue Armory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since its inauguration as a performance space last year, the Board of Officers Room in the Park Avenue Armory has worked hard to carve out a niche for chamber music programming that is every bit as distinct as the monumental talk-of-the-town productions that take place in the Drill Hall. One point of pride is its ability to snag fast-rising European stars such as the pianist Igor Levit or the cellist Istvan Vardai for their American recital debuts.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/arts/ARMORY/ARMORY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Rising Ingénue Shows Off Her Instrument', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Rising Ingénue Shows Off Her Instrument', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Fonseca-Wollheim, Corinna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'na