', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/06/opinion/alaska-oregon-and-the-district-of-columbia-should-legalize-pot.html', 'snippet': 'Three proposed initiatives would help to create a saner recreational-use landscape.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The decision by California voters in 1996 to legalize medical marijuana produced a wave of similar initiatives around the country. Less than two decades later, over half the states allow at least limited medical use. Now it looks as though recreational use of the drug may follow the same path.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yes to Marijuana Ballot Measures ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yes to Marijuana Ballot Measures', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T01:22:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d87d54d-c0bd-5d8e-9357-09be1c4c6121', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d87d54d-c0bd-5d8e-9357-09be1c4c6121'}, {'abstract': 'James’s return to Cleveland began with a preseason game on a gray, chilly day, far from the white-hot atmosphere that greeted him in Miami.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/06/sports/basketball/for-lebron-james-its-home-and-its-