n as a joyful reunion — refugees from African civil strife seeking to rebuild their lives in America — spiraled last week into a national health scare.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/06/us/ebola-victim-went-from-liberian-war-to-a-fight-for-life.html', 'snippet': 'What began as a joyful reunion — refugees from African civil strife seeking to rebuild their lives in America — spiraled last week into a national health scare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DALLAS — The murderous civil war that terrorized Liberia from 1989 to 2003 left at least 5 percent of the population dead, and sent wave after wave of refugees to neighboring countries. To escape the ethnic and political turmoil, more than 700,000 fled from a nation that had barely two million residents when the conflict began.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 848, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/06/us/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 848}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1454, 'width': 1029, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3/SUB-JP-DUNCAN3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard