man-donnelly1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Chic French Cafe Opens in SoHo', 'kicker': 'Food Matters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TLiving', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Donnelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Donnelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a6ef513-45a1-5e3b-b957-5be16c8f98db', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a6ef513-45a1-5e3b-b957-5be16c8f98db'}, {'abstract': 'Rodarte designers Kate and Laura Mulleavy have applied their love of 3-D textures to five new styles of carpet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/06/t-magazine/rodarte-rug-company.html', 'snippet': 'Rodarte designers Kate and Laura Mulleavy have applied their love of 3-D textures to five new styles of carpet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To shape the narrative of each fashion collection, the Rodarte designers Kate and Laura Mulleavy manipulate the structure of their textiles, subjecting fabrics to hand-painting, distressing and even burning. For the Rug Company, the sisters are applying their love of 3-D textures to five new styles of carpet — including porcelain, ivy and marble motifs — that echo some of their clothing’s most memorable patterns. Taking into account “how every thread interacts with each other and how the fibers read in different rooms and light,” they “worked on shades and textures that would make a whole world for someone.”', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '64', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 1165, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/t-magazine/19ten-look-rodarte/19ten-look-rodarte-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dream Weavers', 'kicker': 'By Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dream Weavers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eviana Hartman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eviana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartman', 'qualifier': None,