ve been several stories this past week. But the people affected will represent only a small fraction of the population with health insurance.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07up-cancellations/07up-cancellations-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Plan Cancellations Are Coming, but for Relatively Few', 'kicker': 'Public Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Plan Cancellations Are Coming, but Not So Many', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanger-Katz, Margot', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "America's Health Insurance Plans", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T12:23:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margot Sanger-Katz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margot', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanger-Katz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d09a278-1467-5881-a09b-431b1b5f21aa', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d09a278-1467-5881-a09b-431b1b5f21aa'}, {'abstract': 'Daily Clip Report is a collection of articles about the media and The Times that is emailed each day to senior executives and newsroom managers here.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/10/06/daily-clip-report-34/', 'snippet': 'Daily Clip Report is a collection of articles about the media and The Times that is emailed each day to senior executives and newsroom managers here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Here is Daily Clip Report, a collection of articles about The Times and the media sent by email each morning to senior executives and newsroom editors. The email is produced by the Corporate Communications Department at The Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Clip Report', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k