wing lifestyle brand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The former chief executive of Martha Stewart’s lifestyle brand will be bringing her expertise to an aspiring rival: Gwyneth Paltrow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gwyneth Paltrow Hires Former Head of Martha Stewart’s Businesses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goop.com', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gersh, Lisa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paltrow, Gwyneth', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Anderson, Tracy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Martha Stewart Living Omnimedia Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T16:13:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Haughney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Haughney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6dd0fe8-2f28-5b35-8d0e-3d931d9d755d', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6dd0fe8-2f28-5b35-8d0e-3d931d9d755d'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court decision to deny review of five same-sex marriage cases is in line with an American public that supports same-sex marriage but says its legality should be left to each individual state to decide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/06/same-sex-marriage-supreme-court-polling/', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court decision to deny review of five same-sex marriage cases is in line with an American public that supports same-sex marriage but says its legality should be left to each individual state to decide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Supreme Court’s dec