asn’t.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was raised Catholic. I was one of the first female altar servers when girls were allowed, and I enjoyed Mass as an involved parishioner throughout graduate school in New York. But like many people, I questioned some of the teachings of the Catholic Church from a young age.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-articleLarge.png', 'height': 225, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 225}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-jumbo.png', 'height': 293, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-superJumbo.png', 'height': 293, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/06/us/motherlode-barb-webb/motherlode-barb-webb-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Challenged by My Ca