her design projects at the White House to her line of bold accessories for the Home Shopping Network and a retrospective at the Met — and Maysles’s exploration of her creative trajectory is up close and deeply personal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Albert Maysles Documentary Celebrates the Enduring Style of Iris Apfel', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Festivals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Film Festival', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Apfel, Iris', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maysles, Albert', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Versace, Gianni, SpA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Iris (Movie)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T20:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooke Bobb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooke', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f0eda93-23ae-548e-9a0f-d2b10a818855', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f0eda93-23ae-548e-9a0f-d2b10a818855'}, {'abstract': 'Rain cuts the Formula One race short; Joey Logano wins the Nascar Sprint Cup race in Kansas, securing a spot in the next Chase round.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/automobiles/monday-motorsports-hamilton-wins-chaotic-japanese-grand-prix.html', 'snippet': 'Rain cuts the Formula One race short; Joey Logano wins the Nascar Sprint Cup race in Kansas, securing a spot in the next Chase round.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lewis Hamilton took the victory over his Mercedes AMG teammate, Nico Rosberg, at the Japanese Grand Prix on Sunday. Heavy rain caused pandemonium on the track toward the end of the event, and led to the race being stopped eight laps short of its scheduled distance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/automobiles/07MOTORSPORTS-image/07MOTORSPORTS-i