million-year-old beetle that lived alongside ants, preying on their eggs and usurping resources.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/science/52-million-years-old-and-an-ants-worst-enemy.html', 'snippet': 'Researchers have discovered the fossil of a 52-million-year-old beetle that lived alongside ants, preying on their eggs and usurping resources.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Researchers have discovered the fossil of a 52-million-year-old beetle that lived alongside ants, preying on their eggs and usurping resources. The beetle may have even consumed liquid regurgitated by the ants. The fossil was encased in a piece of amber from India and is the oldest known example of a kind of social parasitism known as myrmecophily. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 320}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 1453, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/science/07FLOA/07FLOA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 