correspondence and other documents relating to Julius and Ethel Rosenberg, the couple executed in 1953 for espionage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/nyregion/newly-released-letters-illuminate-rosenbergs-parental-anxieties.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition opening on Tuesday in Boston includes newly released correspondence and other documents relating to Julius and Ethel Rosenberg, the couple executed in 1953 for espionage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Julius Rosenberg worries that a particular Christmas present suggested for his young sons would be too frustrating, and even dangerous, without parental supervision, which under the circumstances was obviously lacking. “Believe me,” he writes his lawyer, “there’s time and to spare before their development absolutely requires electric trains.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newly Released Letters Illuminate Rosenbergs’ Parental Anxieties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Letters Show Rosenbergs Had Worries About Sons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenberg, Ethel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenberg, Julius', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Letters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cold War Era', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston University', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-06T22:41:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization