trategy behind the overhaul is to focus resources on programming, technology innovation and international expansion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/business/media/turner-broadcasting-home-of-cnn-tbs-and-tnt-will-cut-1475-jobs.html', 'snippet': 'The strategy behind the overhaul is to focus resources on programming, technology innovation and international expansion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time Warner’s Turner Broadcasting System group said on Monday that it was cutting its work force by about 10 percent, or about 1,475 jobs, as the cable television group tries to overhaul its business in the face of ratings declines and a digital revolution that is upending how people watch television.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/business/media/07turner-pic/07turner-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/business/media/07turner-pic/07turner-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/business/media/07turner-pic/07turner-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/business/media/07turner-pic/07turner-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/business/media/07turner-pic/07turner-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10