rticle/714fa922-5dcd-523f-ae42-0672bb1654cc', 'word_count': 904, 'uri': 'nyt://article/714fa922-5dcd-523f-ae42-0672bb1654cc'}, {'abstract': 'The health care system needs to react with greater vigilance and cannot afford to bungle responses when cases reach the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/opinion/stopping-ebola-in-america.html', 'snippet': 'The health care system needs to react with greater vigilance and cannot afford to bungle responses when cases reach the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The widening Ebola epidemic in West Africa — combined with the fears generated by an Ebola patient who carried the virus to Dallas — have led to calls for the United States to screen travelers when they reach American airports. That is a reasonable defensive tactic if done judiciously, although it is unclear if that would have stopped the Liberian man, who carried the virus to Dallas before developing symptoms.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stopping Ebola in America ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stopping Ebola in America', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duncan, Thomas Eric', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guinea', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dallas (Tex)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Securi