the State Department. Mr. Zedillo is now the director of a research institute at Yale University. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mexico: Case Against Ex-President Ends', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mexico: Case Against Ex-President Ends', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zedillo, Ernesto', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T01:13:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Malkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Malkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/d11c7890-efa1-53b9-8706-44199c8a0460', 'word_count': 142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d11c7890-efa1-53b9-8706-44199c8a0460'}, {'abstract': 'With the N.B.A. announcing $24 billion worth of television contract deals, James threw down the gauntlet on future collective bargaining negotiations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/lebron-james-nba-television-deal-revenue-espn-tnt.html', 'snippet': 'With the N.B.A. announcing $24 billion worth of television contract deals, James threw down the gauntlet on future collective bargaining negotiations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDEPENDENCE, Ohio — On a day when the N.B.A. announced $24 billion worth of television contract deals with its holdover network partners ESPN and TNT, the money quote came from its leading man.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 758, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/Y-ARATON/Y-ARATON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Owners Can’t Line Their Pockets Now and Cry Poverty Later, LeBron James Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Owners’ Poverty Claims Are History, James Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank'