1 lead in its N.L. division series, with Matt Carpenter and Kolten Wong contributing homers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/cardinals-ride-john-lackey-and-two-home-runs-to-win-over-dodgers.html', 'snippet': 'Lackey, no stranger to the bright lights of October, helped St. Louis take a 2-1 lead in its N.L. division series, with Matt Carpenter and Kolten Wong contributing homers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. LOUIS — The veteran right-hander John Lackey wore a different shade of red last October when he pitched the Boston Red Sox to a World Series title in Game 6. His opponent that night in New England was the St. Louis Cardinals, the team that traded for him this summer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/07cardinals1/07cardinals1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/07cardinals1/07cardinals1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 797}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/07cardinals1/07cardinals1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 771, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/07cardinals1/07cardinals1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1542, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/baseball/07cardinals1/07cardinals1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/201