ey and using agents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/sports/ncaafootball/big-university-programs-gain-autonomy.html', 'snippet': 'The 65 institutions in the N.C.A.A.’s so-called Big 5 conferences have officially received latitude to govern themselves, which could lead to their athletes getting more money and using agents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 65 institutions in the N.C.A.A.’s so-called Big 5 conferences have officially received latitude to govern themselves, which could lead to their athletes getting more money and using agents. Just 27 of Division I’s nearly 350 members voted to override August’s overwhelming vote in favor of major-conference autonomy. The objections of 75 universities would have prompted reconsideration. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big University Programs Gain Autonomy', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | College Football', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big 5 Gain Autonomy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tracy, Marc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Florida State University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T04:49:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Tracy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tracy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/3dd665d6-4dc7-5ca9-a32f-947a02b90e5a', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3dd665d6-4dc7-5ca9-a32f-947a02b90e5a'}, {'abstract': 'The merger would have created the world’s biggest mining company, but Rio Tinto said it was committed to remaining independent.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/rio-tinto-says-it-rejected-150-billion-merger-with-glencore/', 'snippet': 'The merger would have created the world’s biggest mining company, but Rio Tinto said it was committed to remaining independent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A potential deal to create the world’s largest mining company is off the table, at least for now.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/dbpix-mining4/dbpix-mining4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rio Tinto Says It Rejected $150 Billion Merger With Glencore', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Du Plessis, Jan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glasenberg, Ivan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walsh, Sam (1949- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Glencore International AG', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rio Tinto PLC', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T04:57:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gelles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gelles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/77f944c9-43a7-576a-98be-fd2349e0b1cd', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77f944c9-43a7-576a-98be-fd2349e0b1cd'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/arts/television/whats-on-tv-tuesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '12:30 P.M. (Sundance) TO ROME WITH LOVE (2012) In this Woody Allen tribute to Italian cinema of the 1950s and ’60s, a retired and overly psychoanalyzed music promoter (Mr. Allen) travels with his wife (Judy Davis) to Rome, where their daughter (Alison Pill) has lost her heart to a lawyer (Flavio Parenti). Also in this shuffled anthology, a young newlywed loses her way to the Trevi Fountain and falls into the arms of a movie star, while her befuddled husband (Alessandro Tiberi) tries to keep his relatives in the dark, substituting a prostitute (Penélope Cruz) for her at dinner. An ordinary Roman (Roberto Benigni) is plunged into a swirl of media celebrity. And a fledgling architect (Jesse Eisenberg) finds his relationship with his kind, if bland, girlfriend (Greta Gerwig) in shreds when her neurotic actress friend (Ellen Page) visits. Alec Baldwin, above left with Mr. Eisenberg, plays the older architect — a ghost? a specter of the younger man’s self? — who witnesses the ordeal. “One of the most delightful things about ‘To Rome With Love’ is how casually it blends the plausible and the surreal, and how unabashedly it revels in pure silliness,” A. O. Scott wrote in The New York Times. The movie’s limitations, “as frothy as the milk atop a cappuccino, are finally inseparable from its delights.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on TV Tuesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On TV Tuesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T05:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/436f122d-8ac5-5426-bbc8-1c52f92a99bf', 'word_count': 704, 'uri': 'nyt://article/436f122d-8ac5-5426-bbc8-1c52f92a99bf'}, {'abstract': 'Garnett, 38, the only player left in the N.B.A. from the 1995 draft class, is expected to be a part of the Nets’ starting lineup this season, which may or may not be his last.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/with-purpose-and-perspective-nets-kevin-garnett-enters-his-20th-season.html', 'snippet': 'Garnett, 38, the only player left in the N.B.A. from the 1995 draft class, is expected to be a part of the Nets’ starting lineup this season, which may or may not be his last.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Kevin Garnett is set to begin his 20th season as a professional basketball player and the final one on his current contract. Though he has been brushing aside questions about whether he has plans to retire, he has begun to take an openly reflective perspective on his career.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1334, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/sports/basketball/07nets1/07nets1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Purpose and Perspective, Nets’ Kevin Garnett Enters His 20th Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' With Purpose and Perspective, the Nets&#8217; Kevin Garnett Enters His 20th Season ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garnett, Kevin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T05:07:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67135e4e-bec1-539c-b64b-ba99e37eabda', 'word_count': 714, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67135e4e-bec1-539c-b64b-ba99e37eabda'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Seldes was seldom offstage in a career that spanned six decades, and she was especially known for her performances of Edward Albee’s work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/theater/marian-seldes-regal-presence-of-broadway-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Seldes was seldom offstage in a career that spanned six decades, and she was especially known for her performances of Edward Albee’s work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marian Seldes, a regal personality in New York theater for more than six decades in plays ranging from whodunits to the work of Tennessee Williams, Samuel Beckett and, especially, Edward Albee, died on Monday at her home in Manhattan. She was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'ran