hiefs.html', 'snippet': 'No one this week could match the timid fourth-down decisions of Andy Reid in a loss to the San Francisco 49ers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Week 5, like every N.F.L. week, had its share of fourth-down decisions that hurt teams’ chances of winning a close game. The Colts punted on a fourth-and-1 on their 40. The Texans passed up a good risk late in the game on fourth-and-4 at the Cowboys’ 11. The Jaguars punted on fourth-and-1 near midfield late in the game. (The worst!)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/07/upshot/07UP-bot/07UP-bot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'lega