/abc-evening-newscast-overtakes-nbc-in-ratings.html', 'snippet': 'In total viewers and in a key demographic, the ABC newscast came in first, something that hadn’t happened in more than six years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Riding ratings momentum — and a consistent approach to news — across most of its programs, ABC News broke through in the evening newscast competition last week. It finished first in all the important audience categories, beating NBC News for the first time in more than six years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ABC Evening Newscast Overtakes NBC in Ratings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC News', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC News', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Muir, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Good Morning America (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Today (TV Program)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T18:01:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3692927e-1df0-5cd8-80a4-04b183e44d31', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3692927e-1df0-5cd8-80a4-04b183e44d31'}, {'abstract': 'Libya’s sovereign wealth fund is suing Goldman over $1.2 billion worth of derivative transactions the bank designed and executed in 2008. The bank sought to dismiss the lawsuit but later reversed course.', 'web_u