road. My driver, red-cheeked and indomitable, clambered out of our rickety Toyota to fiddle with a loose starter — not quite what I had ordered at 18,350 feet — and fluid the color of Pepto-Bismol began to leak out of the back of the truck in front of us.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '154', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Heaven’s Gate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heaven’s gate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T20:50:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By PICO IYER', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pico', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'IYER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a902a534-b338-5982-8570-e60394859e95', 'word_count': 3938, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a902a534-b338-5982-8570-e60394859e95'}, {'abstract': 'Our colleagues at the Bits technology blog have the news that Twitter is suing the federal government, seeking to disclose more information about how many personal-data requests it receives from government agencies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/07/from-bits-twitter-sues-uncle-sam-over-data-requests/', 'snippet': 'Our colleagues at the Bits technology blog have the news that Twitter is suing the federal government, seeking to disclose more information about how many personal-data requests it receives from government agencies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our colleagues at the Bits technology blog have the news that Twitter is suing the federal government, seeking to disclose more information about how many personal-data requests it receives from government agencies. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Bits: Twitter Sues Uncle Sam Over D