rticle/1beadb0c-0a6a-5a81-bf64-0b734e0f3840', 'word_count': 868, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1beadb0c-0a6a-5a81-bf64-0b734e0f3840'}, {'abstract': 'More an event than a restaurant, this pop-up serves a monthly meal called Backyard Brunch.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/12/travel/restaurant-report-the-juniper-kitchen-in-nairobi-kenya.html', 'snippet': 'More an event than a restaurant, this pop-up serves a monthly meal called Backyard Brunch.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By midmorning on a Saturday there is a blur of activity in the center of Nairobi, Kenya’s capital, where vendors hawk the day’s fresh produce and artisans try to corral prospective customers. But only a few miles away, down a gravel drive, is the Juniper Kitchen, which offers something strikingly different.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/travel/12SUBBITES1/12SUBBITES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/12/travel/12SUBBITES1/12SUBBITES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/travel/12SUBBITES1/12SUBBITES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/travel/12SUBBITES1/12SUBBITES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 851, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/travel/12SUBBITES1/12SUBBITES1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu