-3fc4-5004-ad00-ca51517c110a'}, {'abstract': 'Many mergers and acquisitions have come from traditional natural gas producers looking to diversify into the oil sector, which has been revived by fracking technology.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/business/energy-environment/energy-mergers-born-of-a-production-boom.html', 'snippet': 'Many mergers and acquisitions have come from traditional natural gas producers looking to diversify into the oil sector, which has been revived by fracking technology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For decades, American oil and gas companies were preoccupied with scarcity. But in recent years, the growing realization that huge volumes of oil and natural gas could be efficiently extracted from beneath the contiguous 48 states has reset the deal-making priorities of nearly every segment of the energy industry. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/energy-environment/08MERGER/08MERGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/business/energy-environment/08MERGER/08MERGER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/energy-environment/08MERGER/08MERGER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/energy-environment/08MERGER/08MERGER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/ener