f7255b1'}, {'abstract': 'A necropsy found that the cub had “blunt force injuries consistent with a motor vehicle collision,” the Department of Environmental Conservation said, but little else was revealed about the mystery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/nyregion/bear-cub-found-dead-in-central-park-was-hit-by-a-car-investigators-say.html', 'snippet': 'A necropsy found that the cub had “blunt force injuries consistent with a motor vehicle collision,” the Department of Environmental Conservation said, but little else was revealed about the mystery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mystery of the bear cub found dead on Monday in Central Park is one step closer to being solved: It was revealed on Tuesday that she died after being hit by a car.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bear Found in Central Park Was Killed by a Car, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bear Was Killed by a Car, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bears', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schlossberg, Tatiana', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parks and Other Recreation Areas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Conservation Department (NYS)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-07T23:25:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tatiana Schlossberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tatiana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schlossberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News