e3b9b90-835c-5fde-84b2-a9731d38ac55', 'word_count': 973, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce3b9b90-835c-5fde-84b2-a9731d38ac55'}, {'abstract': 'Both the Republican and Democratic governors’ associations have set up social welfare groups with the purpose of raising secret political money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/opinion/secretly-buying-access-to-a-governor.html', 'snippet': 'Both the Republican and Democratic governors’ associations have set up social welfare groups with the purpose of raising secret political money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Addicted to each other’s power and money, the political parties and their corporate donors are constantly trying to enlarge their relationship out of sight of the American public. An accidental Internet disclosure last month showed that the stealthy form of political corruption known as “dark money” now fully permeates governor’s offices around the country, allowing corporations to push past legal barriers and gather enormous influence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Secretly Buying Access to a Governor', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secretly Buying Access to a Governor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nonprofit Organizations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Governors Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Governors Assn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citizens for Responsibility and Ethics in Washington', 'rank': 8, 'majo