29-3ca8-59b7-80bd-f5418d24d987'}, {'abstract': 'Republican politicians said they were disappointed by the Supreme Court refusal to hear cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/us/in-utah-the-same-sex-union-battle-shifts-to-acceptance.html', 'snippet': 'Republican politicians said they were disappointed by the Supreme Court refusal to hear cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SALT LAKE CITY — From the headquarters of the Mormon Church to the Republican-dominated state Capitol to rainbow-bannered gay-rights rallies, Utah residents from across the political spectrum widely agreed on Tuesday — grudgingly or exultantly — that same-sex marriage was now part of the fabric of their socially conservative state.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/08/us/JP-UTAH/JP-UTAH-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight