'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f6ab7ea4-dfc9-557f-9a10-0e1a7d39a67e', 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f6ab7ea4-dfc9-557f-9a10-0e1a7d39a67e'}, {'abstract': 'With a wave of highly publicized hirings in the off-season, N.H.L. teams snapped up the best of a new breed of advanced hockey statisticians who have found ways to quantify the game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/sports/hockey/far-from-days-of-original-six-nhl-adopts-complex-numbers.html', 'snippet': 'With a wave of highly publicized hirings in the off-season, N.H.L. teams snapped up the best of a new breed of advanced hockey statisticians who have found ways to quantify the game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Consider hockey: speed and grace mixed with collision and violence. A defenseman passes from the red line to a teammate arcing into the attacking zone, but the puck tips off his stick to another teammate, who tries a quick shot. It deflects off an opponent toward the net, but the goalie gets a piece of it, just as a checker flattens the shooter and the defenseman hops over the boards to be replaced. All this happens in two seconds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/sports/Y-JP-NHL/Y-JP-NHL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Far From Days of Original Six, N.H.L. Adopts Complex Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Far From Days of Original Six, N.H.L. Adopts Complex Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-08T01:50:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'orga