y night’s ugly exchanges between demonstrators and fans, security was beefed up, and the groups were kept apart.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/sports/baseball/less-tension-on-second-night-of-ferguson-protests-at-cardinals-stadium.html', 'snippet': 'After Monday night’s ugly exchanges between demonstrators and fans, security was beefed up, and the groups were kept apart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. LOUIS — As the Los Angeles Dodgers and the St. Louis Cardinals battled during Game 4 of their National League division series Tuesday evening, a group of protesters gathered outside, beyond Busch Stadium’s left-field wall. About 15 demonstrators banged drums and chanted in the memory of Michael Brown, the teenager from nearby Ferguson, Mo., who was shot and killed by the police officer Darren Wilson in August. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Less Tension on Second Night of Ferguson Protests at Cardinals’ Stadium', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Less Tension Arises in Second Night of Ferguson Protests at Cardinals’ Stadium', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Cardinals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ferguson (Mo)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'St Louis (Mo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-08T02:13:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Strauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1eef88a8