ence surrounding the issue is unresolved.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/science/ebola-dog-excalibur-nurse-spain.html', 'snippet': 'Health authorities were concerned that the dog might have been infected and could have spread the disease, but the science surrounding the issue is unresolved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — A dog named Excalibur who belonged to an Ebola-infected nurse was destroyed on Wednesday, even as protesters and animal rights activists surrounded the Madrid home of the nurse and her husband. An online petition calling for the dog’s life to be spared had drawn hundreds of thousands of signatures.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/world/DOG-3/DOG-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 509, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/world/DOG-3/DOG-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 509, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/world/DOG-3/DOG-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/world/DOG-3/DOG-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spain, Amid Protests, Destroys Dog of Ebola-Infected Nurse ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spain, Amid Protests, Destroys Dog of Ebola-Infected Nurse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belluck, Pam', 'rank