yt://article/bab45da1-f170-5117-8763-10ba35872020'}, {'abstract': 'Officials say no one could answer what the president wanted to know most: What was the motive of the attack?', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/cyberattack-on-jpmorgan-raises-alarms-at-white-house-and-on-wall-street/', 'snippet': 'Officials say no one could answer what the president wanted to know most: What was the motive of the attack?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 9:57 p.m. | President Obama and his top national security advisers began receiving periodic briefings on the huge cyberattack at JPMorgan Chase and other financial institutions this summer, part of a new effort to keep security officials as updated on major cyberattacks as they are on Russian incursions into Ukraine or attacks by the Islamic State.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/business/dbpix-hack1/dbpix-hack1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/business/dbpix-hack1/dbpix-hack1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 326}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/business/dbpix-hack1/dbpix-hack1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/business/dbpix-hack1/dbpix-hack1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1113, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/business/dbpix-hack1/dbpix-hack1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'