': 'Betty Buckley mixes Broadway standards with Abbey Lincoln and Tom Waits songs in her “Ghostlight” album and show at Joe’s Pub.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Betty Buckley has just released an album, “Ghostlight,” a collaboration with the great producer T Bone Burnett, an old friend from Texas, that captures more dimensions of her complex musical personality than anything she has recorded before. Broadway standards (“Bewitched, Bothered and Bewildered”) sit comfortably beside gems by Mary Chapin Carpenter (“Where Time Stands Still”), Abbey Lincoln (“Throw It Away”) and Tom Waits (“Take It With Me When I Go”) whose lyrics cut to the bone. In uncovering the truths in song lyrics, Ms. Buckley might be described as a heart surgeon. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1421, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/BUCKLEY/BUCKLEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai