version of cervical-cap insemination, a low-tech intervention that has been in use in doctors’ offices since the 1950s, and had previously been available in various versions by prescription only. It also mimics a popular do-it-yourself method of sperm-to-cervix delivery that goes beyond intercourse: the use of the Softcup, a flexible, reusable cup that can be placed around a woman’s cervix to collect menstrual blood as an alternative to a tampon or pad, to collect and place sperm. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 265}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 906, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/us/motherlode-stork/motherlode-stork-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height':