unty, Colo., where our community has been divided by the decision of a newly elected school board to create a curriculum review committee to evaluate AP history and other learning materials. The debate and accompanying protests have become a matter of national interest, and I’ve found myself in the middle of it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/04/us/COLORADO1/COLORADO1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Heading the PTA, and Challenging the School Board in Colorado', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None,