dard arrangements of standards rarely sat long in any groove or speed.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 156, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 156}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 267, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 1843, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/arts/dance/09lerman-sub/09lerman-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tapping Feet, Uninhibited, Step Up and Pay Tribute to a Voice of Jazz ', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tapping Feet, Uninhibited, Step Up and Pay Tribute to a Voice of Jazz', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords'