rl': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/fashion/furs-in-trippy-colors-wide-brimmed-hats-karen-walker-gilded-eyewear-and-more-shopping-items.html', 'snippet': 'For fall, furs real and faux come in colors not seen in nature; for a glamorous touch, try wide-brimmed hats or gilded eyewear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After seasons of casual fedoras and knit beanies, there are signs that all-out glamour is staging a comeback, this time in the form of wide-brimmed toppers. Amal Alamuddin certainly made it look easy, radiant in a white floppy during her wedding weekend festivities. Hedi Slimane makes a case for them, too, with his devilishly expensive ($1,250!) ’70s-inflected rabbit felt chapeaus for Saint Laurent. Any of the hats here will make an equally elegant point, especially worn with dressed-up but minimalist attire, like the chic white jumpsuit Ms. Alamuddin wore.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/fashion/09BROWSE_SPAN/09BROWSE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 519, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/fashion/09BROWSE_SPAN/09BROWSE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 519}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/fashion/09BROWSE_SPAN/09BROWSE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 885, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/fashion/09BROWSE_SPAN/09BROWSE_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1771, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/fashion/09BROWSE_SPAN/09BROWSE_SPAN-t