pillows.html', 'snippet': 'Needlepoint pillows with long-lasting blossoms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you have the patience to render a hyacinth in tiny stitches, Elizabeth Bradley, a 28-year-old British company, sells needlepoint kits with patterns, canvas and yarn. But if you just want something pretty to toss on your sofa, Elizabeth Bradley Home, a new division, is showing ready-made floral pillows next week at the High Point Market furniture fair in North Carolina.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 187, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 187}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/garden/09CURRENTS2combo/Currents2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'heig