e would pursue a longer-term strategy for independence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/world/europe/catalonias-leader-plays-down-talk-of-secession-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'In an interview, Artur Mas indicated that if he could not hold a legal vote on separation from Spain, he would pursue a longer-term strategy for independence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BARCELONA, Spain — The Catalan leader, Artur Mas, says Catalonia remains on track for its scheduled Nov. 9 vote on whether to break from Spain, but he suggested in an interview on Tuesday that he would not push the country to a constitutional crisis by holding the vote if it were deemed illegal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Catalonia’s Leader Plays Down Talk of Secession Crisis', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Catalonia’s Leader Plays Down Talk of Secession Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Catalonia (Spain)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Referendums', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mas, Artur (1956- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajoy, Mariano', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T00:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2e368f4-4f3b-5c03-b2c8-443876faae2c', 'word_count': 881, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2e368f4-4f3b-5c03-b2c8-443876faae2c'}, {'abstract': 'There were many pro-Confederate conspiracies during the Civil War, but none were as feared as the Knights of the Golden Circle.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/08/a-union-awash-with-conspiracies/', 'snippet': 'There were many pro-Confederate conspiracies during the Civil War, but none were as feared as the Knights of the Golden Circle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Civil War era had its share of conspiracies – some real, some imagined – but few were as feared as the Knights of the Golden Circle, a shadowy pro-Confederate organization intent on leading an armed uprising in the Midwest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-disunion/opinionator-pog-disunion-thumbStandard.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-disunion/opinionator-pog-disunion-thumbStandard.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-disunion/opinionator-pog-disunion-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Union Awash in Conspiracies', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Military)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Treason', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indiana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-1