Vivian Schiller, a veteran news executive who joined Twitter less than a year ago to oversee its partnerships with news and journalism organizations, said\xa0on Wednesday that she was leaving the social network.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1304, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/08/business/08bits-schiller/08bits-schiller-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vivian Schiller Departs as Twitter’s Head of News', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo':