ition of the Modern Sky Festival, which has established itself as one of the premier festivals for indie rock and pop in China.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/chinas-indie-rock-sound-reaches-central-park/', 'snippet': 'New York played host last weekend to the first American edition of the Modern Sky Festival, which has established itself as one of the premier festivals for indie rock and pop in China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the usual medley of joggers, roller-skating dancers, dog walkers, tourists and local residents flocked to Central Park in New York last Sunday to take advantage of the crisp fall weather, the unfamiliar sounds of some of China’s hottest indie bands could be heard emanating from deep in the park.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09sino-music/09sino-music-th