t', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nobel Prizes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modiano, Patrick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T11:12:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Alter and Dan Bilefsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilefsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c965125b-a4cb-5283-bbf2-34c026af44ea', 'word_count': 1007, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c965125b-a4cb-5283-bbf2-34c026af44ea'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The first major aerial and naval battle of the war begins in 1939.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/1939-nazi-squadron-flees-british/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The first major aerial and naval battle of the war begins in 1939.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first major naval and aerial battle of the war began on the North Sea yesterday as a German naval squadron steamed toward the war vessels of the British blockade and German bombers repeatedly attacked them. The British forces attempted to engage the German squadron but the enemy escaped in the obscurity. No British vessel was damaged by the bombers’ attacks. A German submarine was sunk by a French patrol ship. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 10, 1939', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/blogs/09iht-old10/09iht-old10-articleLarge.png', 'height': 37