ng up in the Brentwood section of Los Angeles, an all-politics-is-local protest against a Democratic National Committee fundraiser featuring Mr. Obama at the home of the actress Gwyneth Paltrow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not everyone in Hollywood welcomes President Obama with open arms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama and Paltrow: A Street Artist’s Conscious Coupling', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paltrow, Gwyneth', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic National Committee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hollywood (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T15:11:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Corasaniti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Corasaniti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/218c5763-8277-5457-98df-6077c8c5ff95', 'word_count': 183, 'uri': 'nyt://article/218c5763-8277-5457-98df-6077c8c5ff95'}, {'abstract': 'An animated guide to the precise choreography of eating candy. A whole lot of candy.', 'web_url': 'https://niemann.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/the-gummi-bear-chronicles/', 'snippet': 'An animated guide to the precise choreography of eating candy. A whole lot of candy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My children think they can hide their candy consumption from me. But they fail to recognize my tactical advantage: They mistake me for an ignorant grown-up, when I’m actually an eternal preteen. My relationship to sweets has hardly changed since I was their age. Yes, I might eat candy less often now. But once I start, a precise choreography ensues.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 969, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 969, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/magazine/12gummi4/12gummi4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gummi Bear Chronicles', 'kicker': 'Abstract Sunday', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Gummi Bear Chronicles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Candy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T15:13:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name':