inistry spokesman said Wednesday that the spiritual leader needed to give up his position on “splitting China,” not “make a so-called return to Tibet.”', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/09/china-responds-to-talk-of-a-tibetan-homecoming-for-dalai-lama/', 'snippet': 'A Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman said Wednesday that the spiritual leader needed to give up his position on “splitting China,” not “make a so-called return to Tibet.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'China has cast doubt on the possibility of a homecoming for the Dalai Lama, the exiled Tibetan spiritual leader, following comments from the Dalai Lama and a Chinese official in Tibet that a visit had been informally discussed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China Responds to Talk of a Tibetan Homecoming for Dalai Lama', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dalai Lama', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dharamsala (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tibet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T15:58:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc2b0854-37e4-5816-9b45-4b661f1e28ae', 'word_count': 322, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc2b0854-37e4-5816-9b45-4b661f1e28ae'}, {'abstract': 'The panel will be interviewing people online ahead of the midterm election.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/upshot/about-the-rand-american-life-panel.html', 'snippet': 'The panel will be interviewing people online ahead of the midterm election.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We’ll be publishing several pieces in coming weeks based on data from the RAND American Life Panel, an online survey conducted, as you can probably guess, by the research group RAND. In 2012, the final pre-election result of the American Life Panel was closer to the election’s outcome than that of most other polls.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'About the RAND American Life Panel', 'kicker': 'Pulse of the People', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Population', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rand Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-09T16:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfad0c90-a5f4-51fb-8dd4-38d89d5b4c25', 'word_count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfad0c90-a5f4-51fb-8dd4-38d89d5b4c25'}, {'abstract': 'A sumptuous new bookstore, Albertine, and an accompanying festival of ideas literary, economic and mathematical arrive at the French Embassy’s Cultural Services office on Fifth Avenue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/books/french-embassy-starts-a-festival-and-albertine-a-bookstore.html', 'snippet': 'A sumptuous new bookstore, Albertine, and an accompanying festival of ideas literary, economic and mathematical arrive at the French Embassy’s Cultural Services office on Fifth Avenue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York has alway