ittle Thai Kitchen sets itself apart with its upscale décor and a menu that complements its homemade sauces, which include peanut, chili, sesame and vinegar flavors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/12/nyregion/a-review-of-little-thai-kitchen-in-scarsdale.html', 'snippet': 'Little Thai Kitchen sets itself apart with its upscale décor and a menu that complements its homemade sauces, which include peanut, chili, sesame and vinegar flavors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we entered Little Thai Kitchen in Scarsdale, we were graciously greeted by the owner, Billy Rung, and led to a table with comfortable chairs and a good view of the restaurant. A bouquet of flowers sat on the counter. When we ordered soft drinks, they arrived with the ends of the straw wrappers fashioned into tiny roses.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/nyregion/12DINEWE1/12DINEWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/12/nyregion/12DINEWE1/12DINEWE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/nyregion/12DINEWE1/12DINEWE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/nyregion/12DINEWE1/12DINEWE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/nyregion/12DINEWE1/12DINEWE1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 