he unit’s 10 beds sat empty for years, its team of specially trained doctors and nurses leaping into action only for periodic drills.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1514, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/us/10NEBRASKA1-web/10NEBRASKA1-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Ebola’s Arrival at Nebraska Center, It’s No Longer a Drill', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Years of Empty Beds, a Medical Team in Omaha Puts Its Skills Into Practice', 'name'