rime scenes for a living finds herself pursued by a malevolent spirit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we meet the principals of “The Pact 2,” they are already intimately acquainted with death: Not only does June (Camilla Luddington of “Grey’s Anatomy”) work by day as a cleaner of grisly crime scenes, but she also moonlights drawing horror comics. Her boyfriend, Daniel (Scott Michael Foster), a cop, had a father who ran a mortuary. So maybe we shouldn’t be surprised when the Judas killer (Mark Steger), a malevolent spirit, comes a-knocking for June.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1401, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/arts/10PACT2/PACT2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '