over the language issue. At a hearing Thursday to test his fluency, Mr. Deschene refused to answer some questions directed to him in Navajo, and objected in English that the language test, which had never been used before, had been unfairly designed to disqualify him. He has 10 days to appeal the decision to the tribe’s supreme court. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arizona: Tribe Disqualifies Candidate for Insufficient Language Skills', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Southwest', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arizona: Tribe Disqualifies Candidate for Insufficient Language Skills', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deschene, Chris', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T03:04:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Lovett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfca0993-87dd-52df-9cab-0edff2af3bef', 'word_count': 119, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfca0993-87dd-52df-9cab-0edff2af3bef'}, {'abstract': 'Sean Shaynak, a Brooklyn Technical High School teacher who faces 36 charges including sexual abuse and forcible touching, appeared forever stuck in high school to those who knew him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/nyregion/sean-shaynak-a-teacher-accused-of-abuse-seen-to-have-never-grown-up.html', 'snippet': 'Sean Shaynak, a Brooklyn Technical High School teacher who faces 36 charges including sexual abuse and for