foreign student had been expelled from the country for publicly supporting North Korea.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/south-korea-deported-chinese-student-citing-pro-north-views/', 'snippet': 'A South Korean official said it was the first time a foreign student had been expelled from the country for publicly supporting North Korea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The South Korean Ministry of Justice has confirmed that a Chinese student was expelled from the country for criticizing the South Korean government and expressing pro-North Korea views, in the first such case involving a foreign student. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'South Korea Deported Chinese Student, Citing Pro-North Views', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim Jong-un', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T06:18:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bree Feng', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bree', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feng', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6fccbd1-78fa-55b6-a1b4-8ef5d1fb5230', 'word_count': 656, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6fccbd1-78fa-55b6-a1b4-8ef5d1fb5230'}, {'abstract': 'The lack of a public appearance by the North Korean leader on a major holiday is likely to fuel speculation about his whereabouts and his grip on power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/11/world/asia/in-north-korean-media-no-sign-of-kim-jong-un-at-key-ritual.html', 'snippet': 'The lack of a public appearance by the North Korea