oomberg and Gov. Deval Patrick, and Justices Elena Kagan and Ruth Bader Ginsburg, too.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Five Days In, Virginia’s Governor Will Preside at Gay Wedding', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ginsburg, Ruth Bader', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kagan, Elena', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAuliffe, Terry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Patrick, Deval L', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwarzenegger, Arnold', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T12:30:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Steinhauer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Steinhauer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79a55b8a-63a1-58ce-8431-1e869fbd7f10', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79a55b8a-63a1-58ce-8431-1e869fbd7f10'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: A woman’s protectiveness toward her daughter meant hostility to her child’s new neighborhood, until an act of kindness changed her mind.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/learning-to-love-astoria/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: A woman’s protectiveness toward her daughter meant hostility to her child’s new neighborhood, until an act of kindness changed her mind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Learning to Love Astoria', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Astoria (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T12:45:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dorothy Howe Kelley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dorothy', 'middlename': 'Howe', 'lastname': 'Kelley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1da7be4-2edb-542c-b345-a699aa95387b', 'word_count': 311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1da7be4-2edb-542c-b345-a699aa95387b'}, {'abstract': 'The Philadelphia-based jeweler celebrates his first boutique on Madison Avenue with a striking new collection.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/10/paul-morelli-madison-avenue-la-grange/', 'snippet': 'The Philadelphia-based jeweler celebrates his first boutique on Madison Avenue with a striking new collection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Philadelphia-based jeweler Paul Morelli has remained a well-kept secret within the world of fine jewelry ever since he opened his Walnut Street atelier more than 30 years ago. And now Morelli is taking his brand to a new level, expanding outside his private VIP clientele and the floor at Bergdorf Goodman to open his first standalone store on Madison Avenue. The contemporary 2,000-square-foot boutique is just the beginning — in celebration of the October 16 opening, Morelli has also created the striking La Grange collection, which includes 24 pieces and features what the designer describes as “surface stones.” To arrive at these designs, Morelli explains, “I began playing with the stones and placing them in a way that created a smooth surface rather than linear design.” The uniquely set gems include aquamarines, diamonds, pink tourmalines and yellow and green beryls, crafted into necklaces, earrings, bangles and rings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/t-magazine/09morelli-smith/09morelli-smith-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Paul Morelli, No Longer Fine Jewelry’s Best-Kept Secret', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw