de, according to GIA, the jewels institute.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pink Diamond Auction in Hong Kong Sets World Record', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diamonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AFFLECK, BEN', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Jennifer', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parker, Sarah Jessica', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cartier SA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Ballet', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hong Kong', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T13:26:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow and Jess Macy Yu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': 'Macy', 'lastname': 'Yu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfbeb745-49fe-56fe-bcf4-2017c5cca1bd', 'word_count': 545, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfbeb745-49fe-56fe-bcf4-2017c5cca1bd'}, {'abstract': 'Malala Yousafzai, a Pakistani education activis