lle, Arkansas, and has fond memories of attending the local arts and crafts fairs there. “I loved the experience of being surrounded by so many creative people and seeing their latest designs,” he says. Years later, Ford moved to New York and set up his residential design firm, Brad Ford I.D., but never forgot his time spent browsing for treasures, eating food on a stick and studying the eclectic crowds. So he decided to recreate the atmosphere with Field + Supply, billed as a “modern makers craft fair,” to be held this weekend upstate in High Falls, New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/t-magazine/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 426, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/t-magazine/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 426, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/t-magazine/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/10/t-magazine/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/t-magazine/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C/10beddie-fieldsupply-slide-9Y9C-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Design-Centric Craft Fair Debuts in Upstate New York', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BDDW (Manhattan, NY, Retailer)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T18:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Molvar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Molvar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2c20998-725a-5613-99bd-89310f216969', 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2c20998-725a-5613-99bd-89310f216969'}, {'abstract': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews “Whiplash.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000003169347/movie-review-whiplash.html', 'snippet': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews “Whiplash.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews “Whiplash.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/multimedia/movies-whiplash-101014/movies-whiplash-101014-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/10/multimedia/movies-whiplash-101014/movies-whiplash-101014-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/10/multimedia/movies-whiplash-101014/movie