he international response to the West African Ebola outbreak has affected travel by air, rail and cruise ship. And the news that a nurse who treated the first Ebola victim to die in the United States flew commercially has stoked fears of further spread here. Here is a guide to what has changed, and what, if any, risk there is of transmission on public transportation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Latest on Ebola and Travel', 'kicker': 'Update', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T20:16:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b778de70-a3ab-5ecd-bf51-f67c23b302c5', 'word_count': 764, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b778de70-a3ab-5ecd-bf51-f67c23b302c5'}, {'abstract': 'The actors who play Charlie Price, one on Broadway and the other on the national tour, are each marrying a woman from the theater world this weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/12/fashion/weddings/a-pair-for-kinky-boots-grooms-that-is.html', 'snippet': 'The actors who play Charlie Price, one on Broadway and the other on the national tour, are each marrying a woman from the theater world this weekend.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They are each from Queens; each is cast as Charlie Price, the owner of the shoe factory in the musical “Kinky Boots.” And each is getting married this weekend to a woman from the theater world.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0