 a close race with independent Greg Orman, says he will win because Kansas voters want his party in control of the Senate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wholly unexpectedly, Kansas has moved to the center of the national battle between Republicans and Democrats for control of the United States Senate. Senator Pat Roberts, 78, a stolid Republican ex-Marine who has served in the House and Senate for 34 years, anticipated an easy general election in a state that last elected a Democrat to the Senate in 1932. But in recent weeks Greg Orman, 45, a wealthy business executive and a Democrat turned independent, has surged in the polls by blaming both parties for Washington gridlock.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Questions for Senator Pat Roberts of Kansas', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roberts, Pat', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Orman, Gregory J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kansas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-10T21:18:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Harwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/566d8e63-a77f-524a-9f69-1cc918824c37', 'word_count': 1054, 'uri': 'nyt://article/566d8e63-a77f-524a-9f69-1cc918824c37'}, {'abstract': 'A 65-story skyscraper is planned near Madison Square Park, a neighborhood not yet overrun by luxury condominiums.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/12/realestate/another-glass-tower-at-madison-square.html', 'snippet': 'A 65-story skyscraper is planned near Madison Square Park, a neighborhood not yet overrun by luxury condominiums.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a neighborhood not yet overrun by luxury condominiums but very much in vogue with globe-trotters wishing to acquire a residence with the caliber of amenities and views only a skyscraper can reliably deliver, 45 East 22nd Street is about to assert itself just a stone’s throw from Madison Square Park’s only other modern glass-skinned tower, One Madison. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/realestate/12MADISON/12MADISON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/12/realestate/12MADISON/12MADISON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1200}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/realestate/12MADISON/12MADISON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 512, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/realestate/12MADISON/12MADISON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/12/realestate/12MADISON/12MADISON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_