dens, reflected that sensibility, in clothes from his fall line.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Valentino’s Paris Fashion Week Collection', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spring and Fall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valentino Fashion Group SpA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-11T00:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2236edb3-172c-516c-8959-3c17661cfe68', 'word_count': 61, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2236edb3-172c-516c-8959-3c17661cfe68'}, {'abstract': 'Gordon, who has not won a championship under the Sprint Cup format that was created in 2004, is one of a handful of favorites in this year’s playoff after re-establishing his place among the elite drivers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/11/sports/autoracing/jeff-gordon-seeks-5th-title-after-13-years-of-driving-in-circles.html', 'snippet': 'Gordon, who has not won a championship under the Sprint Cup format that was created in 2004, is one of a handful of favorites in this year’s playoff after re-establishing his place among the elite drivers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CONCORD, N.C. — Twenty-two years into Jeff Gordon’s career as a Nascar Cup series driver, retirement is no longer a hypothetical. He joked about the inevitable in Ja