ot press charges in a fist-flinging altercation involving former Gov. Sarah Palin and her family at a party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/11/us/no-charges-are-pressed-over-brawl-with-palins.html', 'snippet': 'The municipal prosecutor’s office announced without comment on Thursday that it would not press charges in a fist-flinging altercation involving former Gov. Sarah Palin and her family at a party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANCHORAGE — A birthday party donnybrook that has come to be known locally and beyond as the “Palin family brawl” has been ruled a no contest.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Charges Are Pressed Over Brawl With Palins', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Charges Are Pressed Over Brawl With Palins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALASKA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Todd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Bristol', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANCHORAGE (ALASKA)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-11T00:48:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amanda Coyne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Coyne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68230331-2134-5fd0-8cba-e846cb4ed194', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68230331-2134-5fd0-8cba-e846cb4ed194'}, {'abstract': 'Even as many barriers have fallen for working women, they continue to be treated differently on the job, particularly when negotiating a raise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/11/upshot/satya-nadellas-advice-on-raises-stirs-wider-discussion-among-women.html', 'snippet': 'Even as many barriers have fallen for working women, they continue to be treated differently on the job, particularly when negotiating a raise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Satya Nadella, Microsoft’s chief executive, told a conference of women in tech on Thursday that they should not ask for a raise, but trust “faith” and “karma” to reward them appropriately, he not only caused an immediate stir at his own company and other tech companies, but also touched a nerve among women in other industries.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/upshot/11UP-women-ALT/11UP-women-ALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/11/upshot/11UP-women-ALT/11UP-women-ALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/upshot/11UP-women-ALT/11UP-women-ALT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/upshot/11UP-women-ALT/11UP-women-ALT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/upshot/11UP-women-ALT/11UP-women-ALT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10