 'The Cardinals and the Giants have combined to win the last four N.L. pennants and three of the last four World Series titles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matt Holliday stood in the St. Louis Cardinals’ clubhouse Tuesday, plastic covering the lockers, bins of Budweiser nearby, a commemorative T-shirt soaked to his skin. He had just completed his 11th postseason round in six seasons with the Cardinals, winning for the eighth time, defying the notion that randomness rules in October.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1378, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/11/sports/Y-NLCS-1/Y-NLCS-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr