oalition troops to use its bases, including a key installation within 100 miles of the Syrian border, for operations against Islamic State militants in Syria and Iraq, Defense Department officials said Sunday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Troops to Use Bases in Turkey', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Troops to Use Bases in Turkey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANBAR PROVINCE (IRAQ)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saddag, Ahmed', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-12T12:12:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Schmitt and Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57923cc6-e32c-548a-972e-d605fb6da1c7', 'word_count': 657, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57923cc6-e32c-548a-972e-d605fb6da1c7'}, {'abstract': 'The “terrible twos” are merely the beginning of a futile attempt to tame the Bartleby in each of us.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/12/my-toddler-bartleby/', 'snippet': 'The “terrible twos” are merely the beginning of a futile attempt to tame the Bartleby in each of us.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Herman Melville had two truly superlative works: “Moby-Dick,” the 600-page behemoth born in 1851, and “Bartleby, the Scrivener,” a little-known short story published two years later. The genius of “The Whale” (the original title of “Moby-Dick”) is well known, but the brilliance of Bartleby has only recently dawned on me. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/us/motherlode-bartleby/motherlode-bartleby-articleLarge.png', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/09/us/motherlode-bartleby/motherlode-bartleby-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/us/motherlode-bartleby/motherlode-bartleby-jumbo.png', 'height': 393, 'width': 643, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/us/motherlode-bartleby/motherlode-bartleby-superJumbo.png', 'height': 393, 'width': 643, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/09/us/motherlode-bartleby/motherlode-bartleby-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn