y, and the ability for even fake treatments to bring real healing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/upshot/placebos-help-just-ask-this-health-economist.html', 'snippet': 'One patient’s story illustrates the power of mind over body, and the ability for even fake treatments to bring real healing.', 'lead_paragraph': '"I bet you $1,000 that if you just tell me you’re putting Demerol in my I.V. but don’t actually do it, I would still feel a lot better,” I dared the nurse.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-health/14up-health-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLa