}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35b4c937-408a-55c6-8c12-6226ffe06d1b', 'word_count': 650, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35b4c937-408a-55c6-8c12-6226ffe06d1b'}, {'abstract': 'Paris says it has had enough of austerity, but eurozone finance ministers say the French deficit is threatening the unity of the currency bloc.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/business/international/eurozone-finance-ministers-to-discuss-French-budget.html', 'snippet': 'Paris says it has had enough of austerity, but eurozone finance ministers say the French deficit is threatening the unity of the currency bloc.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LUXEMBOURG — The eurozone’s finance ministers began making last-ditch efforts on Monday to avoid a clash with France, which must formally submit its budget for scrutiny by the European Union authorities by the middle of the week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/business/14finmins-pic1/14finmins-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/business/14finmins-pic1/14finmins-pic1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/business/14finmins-pic1/14finmins-pic1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/business/14finmins-pic1/14finmins-pic1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/business/14finmins-pic1/14finmins-pic1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7