d subtle issues, many specific to the particular market.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/upshot/jean-tiroles-nobel-prize-is-also-a-win-for-modern-microeconomic-theory.html', 'snippet': 'A French economist studies how to regulate market competition, which deals with complex and subtle issues, many specific to the particular market.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s complicated.” No, that’s not Jean Tirole’s relationship status. Rather, it’s the conclusion of his research program into how best to regulate market competition. It earned him this year’s Nobel in economics.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1267, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/14/upshot/14up-tirole/14up-tirole-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/