d_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92f3f974-5454-533b-b596-c78f7a5467e5'}, {'abstract': 'The Museum of Modern Art will show a large collection of Altman films, including obscure shorts alongside his well-known masterpieces.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/13/moma-to-present-a-robert-altman-retrospective/', 'snippet': 'The Museum of Modern Art will show a large collection of Altman films, including obscure shorts alongside his well-known masterpieces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you had been meaning to revisit Robert Altman’s most admired films – say, “MASH,” “McCabe & Mrs. Miller,” “The Player” or “Nashville” – or catch up with some you may have missed, the Museum of Modern Art will make it easy for you. It is presenting a 50-program Altman retrospective, from Dec. 3 to Jan. 17. It may not be as easy as binge-watching at home, but the museum has found some films that aren’t readily available on Netflix (or anywhere else).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/arts/13artsbeat-altman/13artsbeat-altman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/arts/13artsbeat-altman/13artsbeat-altman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 864}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/arts/13artsbeat-altman/13artsbeat-altman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 712, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/arts/13artsbeat-altman/13artsbeat-altman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1430, 'width': 993, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',