r)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nitecap (Manhattan, NY, Bar)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Trick Dog (San Francisco, Calif, Bar)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-13T19:21:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Simonson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Simonson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f6c764e-96dc-58e8-a247-0fa55df0f87e', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f6c764e-96dc-58e8-a247-0fa55df0f87e'}, {'abstract': 'Lewis Hamilton won another Formula One race; post-race tempers flared at a Nascar race; Marc Márquez locked in the MotoGP season championship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/automobiles/monday-motorsports-hamilton-harvick-and-mrquez-score-wins.html', 'snippet': 'Lewis Hamilton won another Formula One race; post-race tempers flared at a Nascar race; Marc Márquez locked in the MotoGP season championship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lewis Hamilton handily beat his teammate, Nico Rosberg, on Sunday, in the inaugural Russian Grand Prix. The one-two finish of the Mercedes teammates clinched the Formula One constructors’ championship for the team and extended Hamilton’s lead over Rosberg in the driver’s championship to 17 points. It is still possible to earn up to 100 points in the remaining three grands prix this season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/automobiles/14MOTORSPORTS-image/14MOTORSPORTS-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 298, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/automobiles/14MOTORSPORTS-image/14MOTORSPORTS-image-ar