e start-up in New York City?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/today-in-small-business-business-travel-and-ebola/', 'snippet': 'How to transfer money through Twitter. How to get the most out of Yelp. Is this the hottest real estate start-up in New York City?', 'lead_paragraph': 'What’s affecting me, my clients and other small-business owners today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Today in Small Business: Business Travel and Ebola', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-14T15:03:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gene Marks', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce84dc70-f549-540d-97b0-3f9c5b771f7d', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce84dc70-f549-540d-97b0-3f9c5b771f7d'}, {'abstract': 'It’s a lot of work to pack up your 4- and 2-year old sons and drive home to the Midwest to have a baby, but there are benefits. I’ll be surrounded by friends and family, and have room to breathe.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/driving-halfway-across-the-country-to-have-a-baby/', 'snippet': 'It’s a lot of work to pack up your 4- and 2-year old sons and drive home to the Midwest to have a baby, but there are benefits. I’ll be surrounded by friends and family, and have room to breathe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sitting on the bathroom floor in the middle of the night with my vomiting 4-year-old son, I began to wonder if I was trying to do too much. When his 2-year-old brother caught the same stomach bug a couple days later — a day before we planned to drive to Omaha from Washington, D.C. — I felt my resolve weaken even more.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 606, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1161, 'width': 1963, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/us/motherlode-sky/motherlode-sky-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Driving Halfway Across the Country to Have a Baby', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 