c43f67'}, {'abstract': 'Walter Mischel conducted the famous marshmallow test in the late 1960s to see how children develop and exert willpower. Can we learn to control ourselves?', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/14/can-you-learn-self-control/', 'snippet': 'Walter Mischel conducted the famous marshmallow test in the late 1960s to see how children develop and exert willpower. Can we learn to control ourselves?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Walter Mischel conducted one of the most famous experiments in 20th-century psychology. In the late 1960s, he oversaw\xa0a test at Stanford University using a group of preschoolers. These\xa0studies gave him access to children whom he subsequently tracked for decades, collecting data on each child’s education, health and other factors. Now, more than 40\xa0years later, he’s published a book, “The Marshmallow Test: Mastering Self Control,” about the experiments.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/13/opinion/nyto-marshmallow/nyto-marshmallow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/13/opinion/nyto-marshmallow/nyto-marshmallow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/13/opinion/nyto-marshmallow/nyto-marshmallow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/13/opinion/nyto-marshmallow/nyto-marshmallow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1400, 'width': 1415, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/13/opin