New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/stephen-rosenberg.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rosenberg is the founder and chief executive of Greystone , a financial services and development company based in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Rosenberg, 59, is founder and chief executive of Greystone, a financial services and development company based in New York. Greystone’s recent projects include the Printhouse Lofts in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, and 79 Horatio in the West Village. The company also recently broke ground on Waterbridge 47 in the Dumbo neighborhood of Brooklyn, and On the Sound on City Island. Mr. Rosenberg started the company in 1988. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/15interview/15interview-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/15interview/15interview-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/15interview/15interview-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/15interview/15interview-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/realestate/commercial/15interview/15interview-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/201