ng about it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Checks of police department storage facilities often turn up hundreds, even thousands, of untested rape kits. Some of those kits contain saliva, semen, blood, hair and other DNA evidence taken from victims of recent sexual assaults. Others have been sitting on the shelves unopened for years without analysis or entry of any profiles into state and national databases. Each untested kit represents a botched chance to solve a case and identify other crimes perpetrated by an assailant. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Missed Opportunity to Find Rapists ', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Missed Opportunity to Find Rapists', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forensic Science', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DNA (Deoxyribonucleic Acid)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T01:02:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bd2f42c-129d-5a0b-b576-f43f1db0aac1', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bd2f42c-129d-5a0b-b576-f43f1db0aac1'}, {'abstract': 'The three former prosecutors, one of them a senator, said Vincent A. Cianci Jr., the disgraced former mayor of Providence, R.I., had shown no remorse for his crimes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/us/ex-prosecutors-urge-voters-not-to-bring-a-felon-back-as-providences-mayor.html', 'snippet': 'The three former prosecutors, one of them a senator, said Vincent A. Cianci Jr., the disgraced former mayor of Providence, R.I., had shown no remorse for his crimes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I. — Three former federal prosecutors, one of them a sitting United States senator, on Tuesday warned this city’s voters to reject the comeback campaign of its disgraced former mayor, Vincent A. Cianci Jr. At a news conference here, they said Mr. Cianci had shown no remorse for his crimes, that he had only joked about them and that his promises of future good behavior “ring hollow.” They said he would again run a “pay to play” administration and would hurt the city in several ways, including in its applications for federal grants.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 848, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 848}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1017, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1017, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/15/us/CIANCI/CIANCI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 