2a4a66bb0'}, {'abstract': 'The New York governor is ignoring the political reality of the moment and is depriving voters by not facing off against the other candidates in the race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/opinion/gov-cuomos-debate-follies.html', 'snippet': 'The New York governor is ignoring the political reality of the moment and is depriving voters by not facing off against the other candidates in the race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With New York elections less than a month away, Gov. Andrew Cuomo is on a vigorous campaign to sell his new autobiography. What’s missing from this busy schedule is the political reality of the moment. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '34', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/14/opinion/nyto-1015cuomo/nyto-1015cuomo-thumbStandard.jpg', 