o/0890da6c-a129-5461-94f7-67808bb25719'}, {'abstract': '“Traveling Lady,” at the French Institute Alliance Française’s Crossing the Line festival, is a fashion-driven multimedia concoction inspired by a journalist’s travels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/13/theater/traveling-lady-starring-rossy-de-palma.html', 'snippet': '“Traveling Lady,” at the French Institute Alliance Française’s Crossing the Line festival, is a fashion-driven multimedia concoction inspired by a journalist’s travels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The source material for Jessica Mitrani’s “Traveling Lady” is unbeatable: the pioneering journalist Nellie Bly, who set out in 1889 to circle the globe, carrying only the clothes on her back and a small suitcase. Let the Dorothy Parker witticisms fly.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Exulting in Fashion, Unlike the Plucky Nellie Bly ', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Exulting in Fashion, Unlike the Plucky Nellie Bly ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'French Institute/Alliance Francaise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T15:22:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claudia La Rocco', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claudia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'La Rocco', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e1b49ea-bfff-54ca-a37b-0dac3262b0c7', 'word_count': 369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e1b49ea-bfff-54ca-a37b-0dac3262b0c7'}, {'abstract': 'Castro no le huye a las críticas del estado que construyó.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/opinion/-an-reflexionando-sobre-relaciones-con-eeuu-fidel-castro-responde.html', 'snippet': 'Castro no le huye a las críticas del estado que construyó.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Luego de haber sido omnipresente en la prensa cubana y famoso por sus discursos de varias horas, Fidel Castro ha desaparecido considerablemente de la luz pública en Cuba. Pero a pesar de haberle cedido las riendas del país a su hermano Raúl en 2008, a sus 88 años, al antiguo mandatario le sigue gustando influir en la opinión pública de sus ciudadanos. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aún reflexionando sobre relaciones con EE.UU., Fidel Castro responde', 'kicker': 'Punto De Vista Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' A&uacute;n reflexionando sobre relaciones con EE.UU., Fidel Castro responde', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cuba', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T15:29:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ernesto Londoño', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ernesto', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Londoño', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e79a75dc-a4cf-59e4-a82f-b7c09c4199b5', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e79a75dc-a4cf-59e4-a82f-b7c09c4199b5'}, {'abstract': 'The atmosphere has become so toxic that critics and developers are urging big companies in the $70-billion-a-year video game industry to do more to stop it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/technology/gamergate-women-video-game-threats-anita-sarkeesian.html', 'snippet': 'The atmosphere has become so toxic that critics and developers are urging big companies in the $70-billion-a-year video game industry to do more to stop it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anita Sarkeesian, a feminist cultural critic, has f