ilable to any United States citizen, 18 or older, with a domestic bank account who makes a minimum investment of $1,000.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/solarcity-offers-bonds-online-to-ordinary-investors/', 'snippet': 'The country’s leading installer of rooftop solar systems will issue up to $200 million in bonds, available to any United States citizen, 18 or older, with a domestic bank account who makes a minimum investment of $1,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SolarCity, the country’s leading installer of rooftop solar systems, began selling bonds online to ordinary investors on Wednesday, joining a handful of companies that are using crowdfunding to finance solar development.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/business/dealbook/dbpix-solar/dbpix-solar-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'SolarCity Offers Bonds Online to Ordinary Investors', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crowdfunding (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SolarCity Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T16:03:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Diane Cardwell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Diane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cardwell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2001bf81-6611-5739-997f-ab9257aca538', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2001bf81-6611-5739-997f-ab9257aca538'}, {'abstract': 'In this exclusive video, the visual artist Shantell Martin discusses her process —\xa0and the mural she created for the designer’s West Hollywood store.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/video-shantell-martin-kelly-wearstler/', 'snippet': 'In this exclusive video, the visual artist Shantell Martin discusses her process —\xa0and the mural she created for the designer’s West Hollywood store.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the weekend, passersby outside of the Kelly Wearstler flagship boutique in West Hollywood saw one of the store windows being decorated —\xa0with a single thick, black marker. And in the above video, the visual artist behind the mural introduces herself: “I’m Shantell Martin, and I draw. I draw on everything.” The live drawing helped set the backdrop for her collaboration with Wearstler: a limited-edition collection of accessories, furniture and clothing available in-store and online today. Here, Martin, who creates 90 percent of her work in front of a live audience (and installed a 3-D mural inside the store yesterday), discusses her creative process and what drew her to create this capsule of one-of-a-kind pieces with the designer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Behind the Scenes of the Latest Kelly Wearstler Collection', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Shantell', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wearstler, Kelly', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T16:05:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ff843562-efc3-58c3-8189-9209ce02d8bc', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ff843562-efc3-58c3-8189-9209ce02d8bc'}, {'abstract': 'New Halloween picture books include “Not Very Scary” and “Bob’s Hungry Ghost.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2014/10/15/books/15childrens.html', 'snippet': 'New Halloween picture books include “Not Very Scary” and “Bob’s Hungry Ghost.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'New Halloween picture books include “Not Very Scary” and “Bob’s Hungry Ghost.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 