d likes how Alexa Chung and Mia Farrow dress. This interview has been edited and condensed. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Less Is More in Denmark', 'kicker': 'Intersection', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Less Is More in Denmark', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seasons and Months', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Copenhagen (Denmark)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Denmark', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T17:03:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shern Sharma', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shern', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebcb3176-8c52-5050-8f02-8c1a59bf4dca', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebcb3176-8c52-5050-8f02-8c1a59bf4dca'}, {'abstract': 'A Colorado resort executive helps prepare a training program for workers to help improve relations with consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/business/smallbusiness/a-whole-town-tries-to-improve-its-customer-service-how-could-we-be-a-70.html', 'snippet': 'A Colorado resort executive helps prepare a training program for workers to help improve relations with consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As chief executive of the Steamboat Springs Chamber Resort Association, Tom Kern had a professional interest in ensuring that tourists love Steamboat Springs, a resort town in Colorado. For this reason, the visitor survey results he received in late fall 2013 concerned him.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multime