unexpected ways.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/cookies-music-for-touching-video/', 'snippet': 'The band Cookies combines its influences, which range from Michael Jackson to Timbaland to Paul Simon, in unexpected ways.', 'lead_paragraph': "“People ask me what I’m listening to, and I tell them ‘the best,'” says Ben Sterling, the singer-songwriter at the core of the music collective Cookies. “Michael Jackson, Stevie Wonder, the Neptunes, really prime Timbaland, Prince, Paul Simon — I mean, Paul Simon is one of the best songwriters of the 20th century, Prince is a genius; why wouldn’t I listen to them? They shine light to the world: Those artists and eras are so positive, they feel like home.”", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/15/t-magazine/15symonds-cookies/15symonds-cookies-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Music Collective Offers Up a Pop Grab Bag', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sterling, Ben', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cookies (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mobius Band (Music Group)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T17:36:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By MATT DIEHL', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'DIEHL', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee70e5bc-01de-5226-b714-aeb14132134e', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee70e5bc-01de-5226-b714-aeb14132134e'}, {'abstract': 'On Tuesday night, 10 CFDA Vogue Fashion Fund finalists presented a new design to the Fashion Fund judges, the latest step in this monthslong competition.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/cfda-finalists-have-a-night-off-with-anna-wintour/', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday night, 10 CFDA Vogue Fashion Fund finalists presented a new design to the Fashion Fund judges, the latest step in this monthslong competition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 10 CFDA/Vogue Fashion Fund finalists were trying to relax at a cocktail party at the Ludlow Hotel on Tuesday night. Each of them had just presented a brand-new design to the Fashion Fund judges, the latest step in this monthslong competition. This was supposed to be the let-your-hair-down portion of the evening, but it wasn’t exactly that. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CFDA Finalists Have a Night Off With Anna Wintour', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burris, Gigi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Wes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rykiel, Sonia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wintour, Anna', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Council of Fashion Designers of America', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T17:40:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Koblin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koblin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02b1aede-753e-5deb-98d0-4914a88934ef', 'word_count': 748, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02b1aede-753e-5deb-98d0-4914a88934ef'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Nikita S. Khrushchev was believed to be ousted as the Soviet leader in 1964.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/15/1964-khrushchev-resigns/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Nikita S. Khrushchev was believed to be ousted as the Soviet leader in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Nikita Sergeyevich Khrushchev, the 70-year-old absolute ruler of all the Soviet Union until now, was ‘‘released’’ from both his Communist party and government jobs today [Oct. 15], Tass, the official news agency, announced. ‘‘Advanced age and deterioration of his health’’ were given as the reasons for Mr. Khrushchev’s departure from office, in the official announcement. Neither the Central Committee of the Communist party nor the Presidium of the Supreme Soviet, which both met formally to ‘‘accept’’ Mr. Khrushchev’s resignation, expressed any regret at the move nor showed in any other way that Mr. Khrushchev’s services in office had been appreciated.\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 16, 1964 ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/blogs/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev-articleLarge.png', 'height': 562, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/18/blogs/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 562}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/blogs/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev-jumbo.png', 'height': 960, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/blogs/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1920, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/blogs/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev/18iht-retrospective-Khrushchev-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'image