ng-term earnings, they are more expensive than they have been for most of the last century.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/upshot/part-of-the-problem-stocks-are-expensive.html', 'snippet': 'Relative to long-term earnings, they are more expensive than they have been for most of the last century.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many reasons stocks are falling, from the worries about the condition of the global economy to the unknowable forces that often cause market fluctuations. But beyond those immediate factors, there is also the simple fact that stocks are expensive.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-articleLarge.png', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-jumbo.png', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1053, 'width': 1679, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/16/upshot/17expchart-1413404088163/17expchart-1413404088163-thumbStandard.pn