'snippet': 'From Sony, the 4K Ultra Short Throw Projector transforms a blank wall into a high-definition theatrical experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first thing you notice about the Sony 4K Ultra Short Throw Projector is that it’s hardly noticeable. Many home projectors are installed in a ceiling or rear wall and use lamps. The aluminum cabinet of the 4K projector is long and low and sits inches from the wall, resembling a baseboard heating unit or an ultramodern credenza. It uses a laser to “short throw” a 4K high-definition image with no shadows.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 558, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1116, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/16/garden/1016CURRENTS1/1016CURRENTS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None