alue': 'Furniture', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brechbuehler, Stefanie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Highsmith, Robert', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T21:54:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim McKeough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKeough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8033486-0591-5ebf-9374-bec83bda417a', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8033486-0591-5ebf-9374-bec83bda417a'}, {'abstract': '“Egon Schiele: Portraits,” at the Neue Galerie, unspools the striking evolution of this Expressionist, who would become one of the 20th century’s most popular artists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/arts/egon-schiele-portraits-at-neue-galerie.html', 'snippet': '“Egon Schiele: Portraits,” at the Neue Galerie, unspools the striking evolution of this Expressionist, who would become one of the 20th century’s most popular artists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Egon Schiele: Portraits,” a gripping exhibition at the Neue Galerie, there’s a room where you see Schiele become Schiele. On entering, you find to the left a set of portrait drawings from 1907 that he made during his three years (1906-9) at the Vienna Academy of Fine Arts, where, as a precocious teenager, he chafed under rigidly conservative instruction. In these dutiful charcoals of men and women, Schiele skillfully imitated the anodyne realism preferred by academies all over the Western Hemisphere.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1378, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/arts/schiele/schiele-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Rebel’s Feverish Burst of Insolence ', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Rebel’s Feverish Burst of Insolence', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schiele, Egon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Neue Galerie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-15T21:55:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': No