: 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/sports/baseball/royals-keep-rolling-and-advance-to-the-world-series.html', 'snippet': 'Kansas City continued its charmed postseason by scoring two runs in the first without getting a ball out of the infield, then holding on to win the A.L. pennant — the team’s first since 1985 — in a sweep.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KANSAS CITY, Mo. — For almost three decades, the gold crown above the scoreboard at Kauffman Stadium had mocked the home team. The Kansas City Royals had not been kings of anything since 1985, when they won their only championship. They would never be royal. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 565, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 565}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 964, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1864, 'width': 1980, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/16/sports/ROYALS3main/ROYALS3-1413417973148-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnail