r cost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration began notifying consumers on Wednesday that they should return to the federal health insurance marketplace to renew coverage for next year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Says Consumers Must Renew Health Insurance Policies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Says Consumers Must Renew Policies', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pear, Robert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Counihan, Kevin J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Rachel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T00:39:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Pear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06894658-266d-5d1a-837f-9105714c6115', 'word_count': 700, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06894658-266d-5d1a-837f-9105714c6115'}, {'abstract': 'An unpopular Mitch McConnell seems preferable to an Alison Lundergan Grimes if she’s in the party of President Obama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/opinion/mitch-mcconnell-may-be-unpopular-but-hes-still-leading-in-the-polls.html', 'snippet': 'An unpopular Mitch McConnell seems preferable to an Alison Lundergan Grimes if she’s in the party of President Obama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEXINGTON, Ky. — Senator Mitch McConnell has represented Kentucky almost as long as his Democratic challenger, Alis