5cb4-85ed-7067a92ac047'}, {'abstract': 'The author of a 1996 United Nations report on women forced into prostitution during World War II has refused to retract part of the study, a Japanese government spokesman has said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/world/asia/japan-rebuffed-over-un-report-on-wartime-brothels.html', 'snippet': 'The author of a 1996 United Nations report on women forced into prostitution during World War II has refused to retract part of the study, a Japanese government spokesman has said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — The Japanese government has asked for the partial retraction of a nearly two-decade-old United Nations report on Korean and other women forced to work in Japanese military brothels during World War II, but the report’s author has refused the request, a Japanese government spokesman said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Japan, Seeking Revision of Report on Wartime Brothels, Is Rebuffed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Japan, Seeking Revision of Report on Wartime Brothels, Is Rebuffed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostitution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABE, SHINZO', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coomaraswamy, Radhika', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T10:36:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martin Fackler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fackler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reporte