ive her dream but also that she will remain in Paris while the U.S. national team prepares for next summer’s Women’s World Cup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/sports/lindsey-horan-on-paris-club-seeks-spot-on-us-womens-soccer-team.html', 'snippet': 'Lindsey Horan just signed another contract with Paris St.-Germain, ensuring that she will continue to live her dream but also that she will remain in Paris while the U.S. national team prepares for next summer’s Women’s World Cup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST.-GERMAIN-EN-LAYE, France — There is an American soccer star living in this charming city just outside Paris, a striker from Colorado who rejected a college scholarship offer, moved to Europe to join a top professional team and immediately began scoring goals in bunches. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HORAN1/HORAN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HORAN1/HORAN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HORAN1/HORAN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HORAN1/HORAN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HORAN1/HORAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/17/sports/HOR