 epidemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/16/health-officials-on-congressional-hot-seat-over-ebola/', 'snippet': 'Officials from the Centers for Disease Control and the National Institutes of Health are about to face a grilling from Congress on their handling of the Ebola epidemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Officials from the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention and the National Institutes of Health are about to face a grilling from Congress on their handling of the Ebola epidemic. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Officials on Congressional Hot Seat Over Ebola', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fauci, Anthony S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frieden, Thomas R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Institutes of Health', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T16:33:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Rappeport', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rappeport', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a87bcfa3-c2da-53bb-90e8-1f0ffe75dc44', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a87bcfa3-c2da-53bb-90e8-1f0ffe75dc44'}, {'abstract': 'Here in Rwanda, no one has ever put a hand out to me for a bribe – not once in the near decade I’ve lived here. That lack of hemorrhaging is what will enable us to stop Ebola here.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/16/step-one-to-fighting-ebola-start-with-corruption/', 'snippet': 'Here in Rwanda, no one has ever put a hand out to me for a bribe – not once in the near decade I’ve lived here. That lack of hemorrhaging is what will enable us to stop Ebola here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story of the current Ebola pandemic appears still in its opening chapter. Will the virus be contained, or will it spread its horror across Africa and beyond? The question is being raised around many family tables, including ours, particularly as my wife and I and our three small children, New Yorkers, live in Rwanda where I work in public health and she operates a job training program and a gourmet restaurant. There is a bit of fear in the air here as everywhere, but it is tempered by what we know about Africa.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/opinion/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/16/opinion/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/opinion/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/opinion/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1065, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/16/opinion/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat/16kristof_rwanda_heartbeat-t