'uri': 'nyt://article/58733b23-4c6d-59c6-b1a4-2db0096fe8b8'}, {'abstract': 'Among the dwindling number of sex-oriented businesses in the neighborhood, once a panorama of sex and grime, Playpen is one of the few to still offer peep shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/nyregion/the-live-peep-show-a-relic-of-a-bygone-times-square-endures.html', 'snippet': 'Among the dwindling number of sex-oriented businesses in the neighborhood, once a panorama of sex and grime, Playpen is one of the few to still offer peep shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amid the giant corporate logos and retail billboards of Times Square, the small neon signs seem almost quaint — one with an outline of a naked woman in repose, and others with capital letters blaring the store’s attractions. Adult DVDs. Private viewing booths. All male selection.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/nyregion/PEEPweb1/PEEPweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/17/nyregion/PEEPweb1/PEEPweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/nyregion/PEEPweb1/PEEPweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/nyregion/PEEPweb1/PEEPweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/nyregion/PEEPweb1/PEEPweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na