the artist’s first solo exhibition at a New York City museum.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/arts/design/a-marisol-exhibition-opens-at-el-museo-del-barrio.html', 'snippet': '“Marisol: Sculptures and Works on Paper,” at El Museo del Barrio, is the artist’s first solo exhibition at a New York City museum.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The career of the sculptor Marisol, 84, has often seemed enervatingly episodic. Born Maria Sol Escobar in Paris to a well-traveled and well-off Venezuelan family, she made New York her base but had a tendency to take off on multiyear trips at crucial junctures (once prompting the art dealer Leo Castelli to complain, “How can you leave when things are just beginning?”)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Home in a Wider World, Before It Was the Rage', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Home in a Wider World, Before It Was the Rage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenberg, Karen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'El Museo del Barrio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Escobar, Maria Sol (Marisol)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T20:29:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Rosenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5bcb609-d6eb-5690-9d24-a6bb170f7ff6', 'word_count': 873, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5bcb609-d6eb-5690-9d24-a6bb170f7ff6'}, {'abstract': 'Starting next year, President Obama will press Congress to enact a deficit-reduction plan, overhaul corporate taxes, increase infrastructure spending and approve trade agreements, administration officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/16/obama-to-press-for-fiscal-deals-in-2015-aides-say/', 'snippet': 'Starting next year, President Obama will press Congress to enact a deficit-reduction plan, overhaul corporate taxes, increase infrastructure spending and approve trade agreements, administration officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama’s team says he has the ingredients to make bipartisan deals with congressional Republicans on economic issues in the last two years of his presidency. Trouble is, the recipe sounds a lot like the one that’s yielded gridlock for the last several years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama to Press for Economic Deals in 2015, Aides Say', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T20:31:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U