per preventive measures were being taken.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Several new suspected cases of Ebola were reported in Europe on Thursday, amid heightened fears that measures to prevent the virus from spreading here are insufficient and that more people, especially health personnel attending to Ebola patients, are at risk of contamination.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Europe Evaluates Ebola Measures as Possibility of New Cases Arises in France and Spain', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe Evaluates Ebola Measures as Possibility of New Cases Arises in France and Spain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Breeden, Aurelien', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Doctors Without Borders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T21:10:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Aurelien Breeden and Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Aurelien', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Breeden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97d4d6a1-fe04-501b-bff2-74526b71dc38', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97d4d6a1-fe04-501b-bff2-74526b71dc38'}, {'abstract': 'The figure has declined by a full percentage point over two months, and is now the lowest it has been since November 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/nyregion/new-york-city-unemployment-rate-fell-in-September.html', 'snippet': 'The figure has declined by a full percentage point over two months, and is now the lowest it has been since November 2008.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City’s unemployment rate took an unusually steep fall for the second straight month, dropping to 6.8 percent in September, its lowest level in nearly six years, the State Labor Department reported on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York City’s Unemployment Rate Fell to 6.8% in September', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unemployment Rate in City Dropped to 6.8% Last Month', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGeehan, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Labor Department (NYS)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T21:11:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66ddc59c-15ce-5d61-bb1b-e906c836cdb5', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66ddc59c-15ce-5d61-bb1b-e906c836cdb5'}, {'abstract': 'Andre Holmes and DeMarco Murray are among the players with favorable matchups in Week 7.', 'web_url': 'https:/