in “The Book of Life,” an animated film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/movies/the-book-of-life-directed-by-jorge-r-gutierrez.html', 'snippet': 'A love triangle forms among three lifelong friends who live in a Mexican-flavored fantasy village in “The Book of Life,” an animated film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If swirls of gorgeous, gaudy color were all it took to animate an animated movie then “The Book of Life” — with its showy splashes of acid purples and greens, its tangerine-dream sunsets and big blue-gray moon — would be bursting with as much energy and life as a Warner Bros. cartoon classic. As it is, this often beautiful and too-often moribund, if exhaustingly frenetic, feature tends to be less energetic than the dead people waltzing through it.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/arts/17BOOKOFLIFE/BOOKOFLIFE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 254, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/17/arts/17BOOKOFLIFE/BOOKOFLIFE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 254}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/arts/17BOOKOFLIFE/BOOKOFLIFE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/arts/17BOOKOFLIFE/BOOKOFLIFE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/arts/17BOOKOFLIFE/17BOOKOFLIFE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima