Some bishops participating in a special assembly convened by Pope Francis want the final report to emphasize the church’s boundaries on acceptable family structures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A preliminary Vatican report that offered words of welcome and understanding to gays and unmarried couples has come under heavy criticism from some Roman Catholic bishops who want the final version to emphasize the church’s firm boundaries on acceptable family structures.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Initial Report From Vatican on Families Is Criticized', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Initial Report From Vatican on Families Is Criticized', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality and Bisexuality', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Divorce, Separations and Annulments', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-16T23:21:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurie Goodstein and Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38a32ecb-ce8f-57db-ad36-b6415a9178b6', 'word_count': 621, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38a32ecb-ce8f-57db-ad36-b6415a9178b6'}, {'abstract': 'Nearly all landlords in New York conduct background checks on their prospective tenants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/19/nyregion/a-tenant-blacklist-culled-from-tedium.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly all landlords in New York conduct background checks on their prospective tenants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At New York City Housing Court, on the second floor of a dingy office building in Lower Manhattan, a woman sits quietly with a shawl pulled around her shoulders, looking up names on an old government computer and copying them into a sleek mini-laptop at her side. Behind her, tenants shift anxiously on their feet, clutching paperwork and waiting to speak with one of a handful of clerks sitting behind a glass partition. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19TENANTS1/19TENANTS1-thumbStandard-v2