c-5a5c-9185-6e6abf25b928'}, {'abstract': 'The flames had an appeal I couldn’t resist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/19/magazine/the-origins-of-my-pyromania.html', 'snippet': 'The flames had an appeal I couldn’t resist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My grandfather babysat for me once when I was 4. He left me alone in the living room, probably for no more than five minutes. Unsupervised, I was drawn to my mother’s candle-powered Christmas pyramid, a three-tiered Nativity scene made of wood. I had once seen my mother light the candles ringing the wooden advent wheel. I knew that rising heat from the flames would cause the impeller to spin and the wise men to circle the Holy Family.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '54', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1110, 'width': 1554, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/19/magazine/19lives/mag-19Lives-t_CA0-thu