whole will vote against the credentials of Nationalist China this year in spite of the expected tread in favor of Peking. — New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 18, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1964: Unesco Plea Likely for Peking', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-17T18:53:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b524df5-dadf-5d13-9838-4143a1159d30', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b524df5-dadf-5d13-9838-4143a1159d30'}, {'abstract': 'Honey, anchovies and basil flavor Melissa Clark’s lamb chops with diced green tomatoes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000003182055/lamb-chops-with-green-tomatoes.html', 'snippet': 'Honey, anchovies and basil flavor Melissa Clark’s lamb chops with diced green tomatoes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Honey, anchovies and basil flavor Melissa Clark’s lamb chops with diced green tomatoes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/17/multimedia/clark-lamb/clark-lamb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', '