_id': 'nyt://article/f668e7fd-0bc1-5edf-86d9-092ce783bc55', 'word_count': 43, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f668e7fd-0bc1-5edf-86d9-092ce783bc55'}, {'abstract': 'Even after a fall of as much as 25 percent in oil prices, several reports say it would take a drop of $10 to $20 more a barrel to slow production even modestly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/18/business/energy-environment/us-oil-boom-shows-no-signs-of-slowing-down.html', 'snippet': 'Even after a fall of as much as 25 percent in oil prices, several reports say it would take a drop of $10 to $20 more a barrel to slow production even modestly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — Falling oil and gasoline prices have sent oil company stocks tumbling, but oil experts say the boom in American energy production shows no signs of slowing down, keeping the market flush with crude and gasoline prices low.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 793, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1586, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/18/business/Oil/Oil-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Despite Slumping Prices, No End in Sight for U.S. Oil Production Boom ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Despite Slumping Prices, No End in Sight for U.S. Oil Production Boom', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Clifford', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Energy Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-17T21:33:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Clifford Krauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/84e60d99-2d61-5cb3-bf3c-789a715ba26e', 'word_count': 1051, 'uri': 'nyt://article/84e60d99-2d61-5cb3-bf3c-789a715ba26e'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Stoppard’s masterpiece offers piquant ruminations on love, time and mathematics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/19/nyregion/a-review-of-arcadia-by-tom-stoppard-at-yale-repertory-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Stoppard’s masterpiece offers piquant ruminations on love, time and mathematics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tom Stoppard is just so much smarter than the rest of us. But don’t let that intimidate you. Yes, his witty, winning masterpiece, “Arcadia,” at Yale Repertory Theater, brims with difficult questions in physics, biology and higher mathematics. But this miraculous play is also loaded with good jokes, about sex and poetry, sex and pedantry, sex and everything. Given enough time, grouse, turtles and rabbits multiply into infinity and dwindle into nonexistence, as we all must. Yet, the playwright reminds us, there’s much good dancing to be had along the way. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19ARTSCT2/19ARTSCT2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 