d-5eac-8722-2e7d763fa25b', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/51d64733-e25d-5eac-8722-2e7d763fa25b'}, {'abstract': 'Bluefish, found throughout much of the world, can be caught with a net, rod and reel, or just a can, a bobber and a hooked line.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/17/ravenous-opportunist-known-by-many-aliases/', 'snippet': 'Bluefish, found throughout much of the world, can be caught with a net, rod and reel, or just a can, a bobber and a hooked line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bluefish are sleek and beautiful, and they are exquisitely adapted to life in a variety of saltwater environs. They are found throughout much of the world, and a New York City bluefish is essentially the same fish as the one swimming off the African coast, or the breaking waves of a mild Mediterranean surf. About the only waters where you will not find this sleek predator are within a small part of the northern Pacific. Equally popular at the end of a hook or on the fanciest dinner plate, bluefish are frequent features on restaurant menus.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19NATURE/19NATURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19NATURE/19NATURE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19NATURE/19NATURE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/19/nyregion/19NATURE/19NATURE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy