ay’s board, months after publicly defending his role as a director against attacks from Carl C. Icahn.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/20/andreessen-steps-down-from-ebay-board-ahead-of-paypal-spinoff/', 'snippet': 'The venture capitalist Marc Andreessen is stepping down from eBay’s board, months after publicly defending his role as a director against attacks from Carl C. Icahn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Months after publicly defending his role as an eBay director against Carl C. Icahn, the venture capitalist Marc Andreessen is now stepping down from eBay’s board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/21/business/dbpix-andreessen/dbpix-andreessen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'capt