etectives of at least three other bodies in Gary, Ind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GARY, Ind. — Last Friday evening, a 19-year-old woman named Afrikka Hardy arrived as scheduled at a Motel 6 near here. She was there to meet a 43-year-old man who had arranged the encounter through Backpage.com, a classified site routinely used to advertise prostitutes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/us/JP-GARY2/JP-GARY2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 260, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/us/JP-GARY2/JP-GARY2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 260, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/us/JP-GARY2/JP-GARY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/21/us/JP-GARY2/JP-GARY2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/us/JP-GARY2/JP-GARY2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Motel Meeting in Indiana Leads to Gruesome Confession ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Motel Meeting in Indiana Leads to Gruesome Confession', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vann, Darren Deon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Serial Murders', 'rank': 5, 'majo