mes that is emailed each day to senior executives and newsroom managers here.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/10/20/daily-clip-report-44/', 'snippet': 'Daily Clip Report is a collection of articles about the media and The Times that is emailed each day to senior executives and newsroom managers here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Here is Daily Clip Report, a collection of articles about The Times and the media sent by email each morning to senior executives and newsroom editors. The email is produced by the Corporate Communications Department at The Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Clip Report', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-20T13:00:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jordan Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jordan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2be3cd94-118c-5d19-9dd4-febb246312d7', 'word_count': 168, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2be3cd94-118c-5d19-9dd4-febb246312d7'}, {'abstract': 'China, a leading trading partner to many African countries, has been urged to take a more active role in the Ebola fight.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/20/beijing-donates-6-million-for-food-aid-in-ebola-fight/', 'snippet': 'China, a leading trading partner to many African countries, has been urged to take a more active role in the Ebola fight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Chinese government, eager to show it is committed to the fight against the Ebola epidemic, announced on Monday that it was donating $6 million to the United Nations World Food Program. The assistance is to be divided equally among the three West African countri