defective ignition switches, bringing the total of claims eligible for compensation so far to 56.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/21/business/death-toll-rises-to-29-in-gm-switch-defect.html', 'snippet': 'Two additional fatalities have been linked to defective ignition switches, bringing the total of claims eligible for compensation so far to 56.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another two fatalities have been added to the death toll linked to General Motors’ defective ignition switch, bringing the total to 29.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Death Toll Rises to 29 in G.M. Switch Defect', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feinberg, Kenneth R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-20T17:42:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Stout', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stout', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/17491f65-f656-5fa3-80ab-4d3e00dc264a', 'word_count': 199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/17491f65-f656-5fa3-80ab-4d3e00dc264a'}, {'abstract': 'I’ve started playing this game during market volatility: When someone tells me the market is scary, I increase my investments. It takes the desire to act and harnesses it for good.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/20/your-money/stocks-and-bonds/when-the-markets-get-noisy-invest-5.html', 'snippet': 'I’ve started playing this game during market volatility: When someone tells me the market is scary, I increase my investments. It takes the desire to act and harnesses it for good.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My, how things change. In the space of just a few weeks, we went from talking about boring markets to reading scary headlines that change by the hour. (Or by the second, if you watch Twitter.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/20/business/102014bucks-carl-sketch/102014bucks-carl-sketch-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When the Markets Get Noisy, Invest $5', 'kicker': 'Sketch Guy', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-20T17:48:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'subsection_name': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/669c0cea-72ff-51bc-a9c7-2218f0ad1295', 'word_count': 647, 'uri': 'nyt://article/669c0cea-72ff-51bc-a9c7-2218f0ad1295'}, {'abstract': 'The one-day festival, now in its 12th year, will bring together musical styles from all corners of the globe in January.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/20/globalfest-2015-will-offer-a-broad-view-of-world-music/', 'snippet': 'The one-day festival, now in its 12th year, will bring together musical styles from all corners of the globe in January.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An Afrobeat orchestra from Brazil, an American ensemble devoted to music of the Sufi mystics, a Moroccan-Israeli singer of Jewish and Arabic songs and a Hawaiian swing band are among the lures of Globalfest 2015, an immersion in hybrid forms of world music and pop. The one-day festival, now in its 12th year, will be presented on three stages at Webster Hall on Jan. 11.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/ARTS1/ARTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'h