b931f1c'}, {'abstract': 'The composer John Adams conducted players from Yale and the Brentano String Quartet in a program that included his “Absolute Jest,” inspired by Beethoven.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/21/arts/music/for-john-adams-a-day-of-music-not-protests.html', 'snippet': 'The composer John Adams conducted players from Yale and the Brentano String Quartet in a program that included his “Absolute Jest,” inspired by Beethoven.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About 24 hours before protests organized by various Jewish groups against the Metropolitan Opera’s production of John Adams’s “The Death of Klinghoffer” were anticipated to start at Lincoln Center, Mr. Adams was at Avery Fisher Hall on Sunday afternoon, conducting the Philharmonia Orchestra of Yale in a terrific concert. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1296, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/21/arts/yale/yale-thumbStandard.jpg'