ped source of capital, private equity firms are seeking to attract checks in the tens of thousands of dollars rather than in the hundreds of millions.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/20/private-equity-titans-open-cloistered-world-to-smaller-investors/', 'snippet': 'Seeing individual investors as a largely untapped source of capital, private equity firms are seeking to attract checks in the tens of thousands of dollars rather than in the hundreds of millions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For decades, David M. Rubenstein has persuaded big institutions like pension funds and university endowments to invest billions of dollars with his private equity firm, the Carlyle Group, promising them better returns than the general market. But in recent months, he has crisscrossed the country in a campaign to attract a type of investor that has relatively little experience in this industry: individuals.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/Private/Private-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/21/business/Private/Private-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/Private/Private-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/Private/Private-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/business/Private/Private-thumbStandard.jp