 Scenes of Mother Panda and Cub Filmed in the Wild', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pandas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sichuan Province (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-21T08:17:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ecc6917-8ec4-55c7-bd02-dd0e6e5e18b7', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ecc6917-8ec4-55c7-bd02-dd0e6e5e18b7'}, {'abstract': 'The company’s shares declined to a record low on Monday over its exposure to a company linked to the Espírito Santo family, prompting the ban.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/21/regulators-temporarily-ban-short-selling-of-portugal-telecom/', 'snippet': 'The company’s shares declined to a record low on Monday over its exposure to a company linked to the Espírito Santo family, prompting the ban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – Regulators in Portugal and Britain have temporarily banned short-selling of Portugal Telecom’s stock after the company’s shares declined to a record low on Monday over its exposure to a company with ties to the Espírito Santo family.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/22/business/dbpix-portugal-telecom/dbpix-portugal-telecom-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 348, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/22/business/