. For each Proper product sold, 50 cents is donated to water sanitation and water-access projects in the developing world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Soap Start-Up Looks to Clean Up (and Do Some Good)', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cleansers, Detergents and Soaps', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-21T11:00:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eilene Zimmerman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eilene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zimmerman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82a31428-ebb7-507e-ab3a-0a36482ead78', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82a31428-ebb7-507e-ab3a-0a36482ead78'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama says he now believes that the Constitution guarantees a right to same-sex marriage in all 50 states, but supports the more incremental approach taken by the Supreme Court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/21/today-in-politics-20/', 'snippet': 'President Obama says he now believes that the Constitution guarantees a right to same-sex marriage in all 50 states, but supports the more incremental approach taken by the Supreme Court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Obama Evolves Further on Same-Sex Marriage ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag