endment’s guarantee of an individual’s right to counsel a reality for all Americans.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/21/exclusive-right-to-counsel-is-the-kochs-new-cause/', 'snippet': 'Koch Industries is teaming up with a defense lawyers group “to make the Sixth Amendment’s guarantee of an individual’s right to counsel a reality for all Americans.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Koch brothers have been pouring tens of millions of dollars into efforts to elect Republicans next month. Now they are directing money to a more obscure cause.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Exclusive: Right to Counsel Is the Kochs’ New Cause', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Defenders and Court-Appointed Lawyers (Criminal)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sixth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Koch, Charles G', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Koch Industries Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of Criminal Defense Lawyers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-21T19:15:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Hulse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hulse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a6e0f86-6a4a-515a-95da-3be2fc6b82da', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a6e0f86-6a4a-515a-95da-3be2fc6b82da'}, {'abstract': 'The sedan is a luxury land yacht that the company hopes will change its economy-car image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/22/automobiles/autoreviews/video-with-the-k900-kia-takes-a-shot-beyond-the-3-point-line.html', 'snippet': 'The sedan is a luxury land yacht that the company hopes will change its economy-car image.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kia is heading upmarket with the K900. To help sell more of the large sedans, the N.B.A. superstar LeBron James signed on as the car’s “luxury ambassador.” Apparently, he wants all of us to know it is right at home next to his Porsches, Lamborghinis and Ferraris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 515, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1030, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/21/multimedia/driven-kia-k900/driven-kia-k900-thumbL