ampaign manager tweeted with apparent pleasure at the sight of the Team Mitch bus pulled over on the side of a Kentucky highway with a police car in tow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alison Lundergan Grimes’s campaign is keeping close tabs on her opponent, Senator Mitch McConnell. Her deputy campaign manager, Phillip Thompson, tweeted with apparent pleasure Tuesday at the sight of the McConnell campaign bus — Team Mitch — pulled over on the side of a Kentucky highway with a police car in tow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Team Mitch, ‘Sidelined’? Not So Fast', 'kicker': 'First Draft', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grimes, Alison Lundergan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McConnell, Mitch', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Phillip', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-21T19:29:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By First Draft', 'person': [{'firstname': 'First', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Draft', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/07fbbae8-a300-563f-bb44-b95b00b4cf92', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/07fbbae8-a300-563f-bb44-b95b00b4cf92'}, {'abstract': 'A new study on politics and media – including social media – sheds some fresh light on how the political echo chamber is reverberating online.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/politics/first-draft/2014/10/21/liberals-less-friendly-to-opposing-views-on-facebook/', 'snippet': 'A new study on politics and media – including social media – sheds some fresh light on how the political echo chamber is re