st (that would be Miami). But it has a vibrant downtown flush with high-end accouterments — a luxury pet boutique, a fancy popcorn store, top-notch ethnic and seafood restaurants, art galleries and a relaxed, good-time feeling (most evident when sampling the night life) — along with natural beauty that ranges from lush wetlands to white-sand beaches. It’s no wonder that everyone, including Europeans and young professionals, is flocking to this sliver of Florida’s gilded coast. Naples’s days as a sleepy backwater and humdrum retirement community are over.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 626}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 982, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1964, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/26/travel/26-hours-promo/26-hours-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cre