ron, whose “You Got Older” is about to start performances at Here, leans on her own experiences and fantasies to ponder fate, faith and family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/theater/clare-barron-discusses-her-new-play-you-got-older.html', 'snippet': 'The playwright Clare Barron, whose “You Got Older” is about to start performances at Here, leans on her own experiences and fantasies to ponder fate, faith and family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The playwright and actor Clare Barron fell in love with the theater as a teenage Shakespearean: “I get to slap someone? Like, that’s so cool! I get to spit in someone’s face? That’s like even cooler!”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1977, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1977}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 311, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 622, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/26SNAPSHOT/26SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp