 {'abstract': 'Many established spas and retreats are retooling their offerings to attract the same target: wealthy, successful and highly stressed-out executives.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/23/your-money/health-spas-aimed-at-teaching-stressed-executives-to-unwind.html', 'snippet': 'Many established spas and retreats are retooling their offerings to attract the same target: wealthy, successful and highly stressed-out executives.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The irony did not escape Paula Thompson. As a regional vice president of a firm helping scores of companies administer wellness programs for their employees, the 58-year-old Ohio executive was not practicing what she preached. Years of job stress and a road-food diet left her out of shape, overweight and exhausted.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Boot Camp Than Spa', 'kicker': 'Special Section: Wealth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Boot Camp Than Spa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sullivan, Paul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'High Net Worth Individuals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Canyon Ranch', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'VeraVia', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Golden Door Spa (Escondido, Calif)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-23T00:09:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk':