.com/2014/10/23/arts/rene-burri-photographer-of-picasso-and-che-dies-at-81.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Burri was a globe-trotting photographer who documented figures like Pablo Picasso and Che Guevara, as well as urban scenes and war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'René Burri, a globe-trotting photographer who saw his camera as a “magic wand,” as he put it, to illuminate the “pulse of life” — whether an expression on Picasso’s face, a surreal urban scene or the ravages of war — died on Monday in Zurich. He was 81.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'René Burri, Photographer of Picasso and Che, Dies at 81 ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'René Burri, Photographer of Picasso and Che, Dies at 81', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burri, Rene (1933-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Douglas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Picasso, Pablo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guevara, Ernesto', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-23T01:19:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/298742be-53b9-5daa-9d7b-d2faa2816bc0', 'word_count': 882, 'uri': 'nyt://article/298742be-53b9-5daa-9d7b-d2faa2816bc0'}, {'abstract': 'Major League Baseball announced a new set of awards to replace the Rolaids relief pitcher award.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/23/sports/baseball/world-series-2014-sf-giants-kansas-city-royals-relievers-in-al-nl-get-new-awards.html', 'snippet': 'Major League Baseball announced a new set of awards to replace the Rolaids relief pitcher award.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KANSAS CITY, Mo. — Major League Baseball announced a new set of awards for relief pitchers to replace the old Rolaids relief pitcher award. The awards are for the best relief pitcher in the American League, named after Mariano Rivera, the longtime Yankees closer and the career saves leader, and for the best reliever in the National League. That award is named for Trevor Hoffman, who recorded 601 saves, all in the N.L. and mostly with the San Diego Padres.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1549, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/23/sports/Y-SERIESNOTES/Y-SERIESNOTES-thumbStandar