rd-generation dealer Jules Maeght hopes to make his mark on San Francisco with “Art in Motion,” his new gallery’s inaugural show.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/jules-maeght-unveils-art-in-motion.html', 'snippet': 'The third-generation dealer Jules Maeght hopes to make his mark on San Francisco with “Art in Motion,” his new gallery’s inaugural show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1945 the dealers Aimé and Marguerite Maeght opened the first Galerie Maeght in Paris with a show of wartime drawings by Henri Matisse. It soon became a locus for the postwar avant-garde, showing everyone from Marcel Duchamp to Joan Miró and becoming so successful that, at one time or another, it had a second Paris branch, and outposts in Barcelona, New York and Zurich.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/26MOTION5/26MOTION5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/26MOTION5/26MOTION5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/26MOTION5/26MOTION5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/26MOTION5/26MOTION5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/arts/artsspecial/26MOTION5/26MOTION5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 't