d', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/954e4818-9873-59ee-8cde-448faaaceeed'}, {'abstract': 'In “John Wick,” a thriller starring Keanu Reeves, the protagonist resumes his career as an assassin after villains break into his home and kill his dog.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/24/movies/in-john-wick-keanu-reeves-as-an-avenger.html', 'snippet': 'In “John Wick,” a thriller starring Keanu Reeves, the protagonist resumes his career as an assassin after villains break into his home and kill his dog.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When a movie character’s last name is synonymous with “fuse,” the audience will be wondering when to expect his meltdown. In “John Wick,” that happens not when John’s beloved wife — who has finally succumbed to a long illness — has been laid in the ground, and not when Iosef (Alfie Allen), the loutish son of a Russian mob boss, accosts him at a gas station. For John (Keanu Reeves), the ultimate insult comes when Iosef and his thugs break into John’s upscale home and kill his dog.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/JOHNWICK/JOHNWICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/JOHNWICK/JOHNWICK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/JOHNWICK/JOHNWICK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/JOHNWICK/JOHNWICK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1356, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': N