icle/f26038ac-a9bc-59ce-ab7b-1e0459c63ef1', 'word_count': 968, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f26038ac-a9bc-59ce-ab7b-1e0459c63ef1'}, {'abstract': '“Revenge of the Green Dragons,” by Andrew Lau and Andrew Loo, shows the violent side of immigrant life in 1980s New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/24/movies/revenge-of-the-green-dragons-by-andrew-lau-and-andrew-loo.html', 'snippet': '“Revenge of the Green Dragons,” by Andrew Lau and Andrew Loo, shows the violent side of immigrant life in 1980s New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew Lau’s “Infernal Affairs” trilogy became the best-known import in the early 2000s from the storied Hong Kong film industry, supplying Martin Scorsese with material for his Academy Award-winning film “The Departed.” But while Mr. Lau’s latest, “Revenge of the Green Dragons,” leaps forth with a flurry of montage, attitude and action, it loses its way as a drama.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/24REVENGE/REVENGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 868, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/24REVENGE/REVENGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 868}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/24REVENGE/REVENGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/24REVENGE/REVENGE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1417, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/arts/24REVENGE/REVENGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,