more.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/24/world/europe/britain-pledges-millions-to-fight-ebola-and-chides-others-to-spend-more.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister David Cameron of Britain said his country had already promised more aid than any other in Europe to fight Ebola in West Africa, but said, “we need other European countries to do more.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — With the World Health Organization warning that Ebola is still spreading “exponentially” in the hardest-hit countries of West Africa, Britain\xa0on Thursday\xa0indicated it would sharply increase its funding to fight the disease and pushed its fellow European countries that have been less willing to contribute to the battle against a virus that has killed nearly 5,000 Africans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/24/us/EBOLA2/EBOLA2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt