ld face oil, a driverless car and socks by Snoop Dogg.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Dual Review of What’s New, Starring Marianne Faithfull and Mike Tyson', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-10-24T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89d5ce5b-0db4-543f-9c37-42fdc17fdaa7', 'word_count': 18, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89d5ce5b-0db4-543f-9c37-42fdc17fdaa7'}, {'abstract': "Juice Generation's new Beauty Bombs collection is comprised of a series of drinks infused with ingredients prized for their complexion-boosting benefits.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/24/t-magazine/juice-generation-beauty-bombs.html', 'snippet': "Juice Generation's new Beauty Bombs collection is comprised of a series of drinks infused with ingredients prized for their complexion-boosting benefits.", 'lead_paragraph': 'Cold-pressed juices often flow backstage at fashion shows, where everyone from models to makeup artists can be seen clutching bottles full of green liquid. It might just be a matter of correlation, but connoisseurs tend to credit the beverages for promoting gloriously radiant, dewy skin. Perhaps realizing this connection, Juice Generation is gearing up to launch its new Beauty Bombs collection, a series of drinks infused with ingredients normally found in the skincare aisle, such as detoxifying clays, pore-refining charcoal and hydrating rosewater. The hope is that when consumed internally, these elements will impart all the complexion-enhancing benefits of, say, a great face mask, while also benefiting the body. The range includes two shots — Pure Earth (with bentonite clay, alkaline water and rosewater) and Le Détox (with French green clay and cucumber water) — and three juices: Activated Lemonade, Activated Greens and Activated Protein, all spiked with charcoal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/t-magazine/24symonds-juice/24symonds-juice-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Pressed-Juice Purveyor Steps Into Skincare', 'kicker': 'On Beauty', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Juices', 'rank': 1, 'major