e.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/24/preparing-a-child-to-own-a-mobile-phone-but-not-always-use-it/', 'snippet': 'Having a phone can create a compulsion to do something when doing nothing is so often the better choice.', 'lead_paragraph': '“She’s going to be a few minutes late.” “I told her we’re almost there.” “Her train is being held at the station.” “I told her we’re here.” “I’m asking her where she is.” “The train is moving again.” “She’s almost here.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-articleLarge.png', 'height': 276, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 276}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-jumbo.png', 'height': 331, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-superJumbo.png', 'height': 331, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/24/us/motherlode-mobile3/motherlode-mobile3