ticle/5428bc8a-db17-5cb5-8b19-4b8c162453b5'}, {'abstract': 'Politics seems to have been as big a motive for presidential appearances over the decades as love of the national pastime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/25/upshot/the-president-attends-the-world-series.html', 'snippet': 'Politics seems to have been as big a motive for presidential appearances over the decades as love of the national pastime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first time a sitting American president went to the World Series was in October 1915, when Woodrow Wilson brought his just-announced fiancée, Edith Bolling Galt — in their first public appearance since their engagement — to Philadelphia’s Baker Bowl, for the Phillies’ second game against the Red Sox.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/upshot/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 478, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/23/upshot/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 478}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/upshot/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 815, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/upshot/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1630, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/23/upshot/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt/25UP-Beschloss-Roosevelt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thum