{'abstract': 'Participants in Liberia and Sierra Leone would receive experimental vaccines that could lead to mass inoculations in 2015, health officials said Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/25/business/ebola-vaccine-trials-planned-for-december.html', 'snippet': 'Participants in Liberia and Sierra Leone would receive experimental vaccines that could lead to mass inoculations in 2015, health officials said Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Public health authorities said on Friday that they hoped to begin trials of Ebola vaccines in disease-ravaged West Africa as early as December and could know around April whether they were effective, clearing the way for possible mass inoculations to stem the epidemic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Officials Expect to Start Vaccine Trials in West Africa as Early as December ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Officials Expect to Start Vaccine Trials in West Africa as Early as December', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GlaxoSmithKline PLC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Health Organization', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-24T15:35:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': N