r excellence designed by the starchitect Frank Gehry, opens its doors to the public on Oct. 27. Festivities began a week earlier, with a presidential dinner held on Monday for dignitaries from fashion, art and politics, and have continued throughout FIAC week, when the City of Light’s mellow art scene ignites with international visitors and a full slate of aesthetic attractions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fondation Louis Vuitton Opens at Last', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARNAULT, BERNARD', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gehry, Frank', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Louis Vuitton Foundation for Creation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-24T19:15:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin McGarry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGarry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fc8cf93-7185-5f4c-b852-7d7dbe405c1c', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fc8cf93-7185-5f4c-b852-7d7dbe405c1c'}, {'abstract': 'Julia Moskin prepares this Thanksgiving favorite with toasted pecans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000003195466/classic-cranberry-sauce.html', 'snippet': 'Julia Moskin prepares this Thanksgiving favorite with toasted pecans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Julia Moskin prepares this Thank