eir bodies in Cynthia Oliver’s “Boom!”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/25/arts/dance/cynthia-olivers-boom-at-new-york-live-arts.html', 'snippet': 'Two dancers energetically celebrate and explore the abilities of their bodies in Cynthia Oliver’s “Boom!”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cynthia Oliver’s “Boom!” starts with just that. On Thursday at New York Live Arts, the lights had just dimmed when the theater door slammed shut. An indiscreet latecomer? A flurry of affable bickering erupted as the culprits — Ms. Oliver and Leslie Cuyjet — descended through the audience and onto the stage like a pair of gabbing best friends, or maybe mother and daughter.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1459, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/OLIVER/OLIVER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Besties Feeling the Power', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Two Besties Feeling the Power', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oliver, Cynthia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Live Arts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuyjet, Leslie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-24T19:34:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siobhan Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siobhan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/16d7dc39-9477-5360-9d50-ad4ab5b9a212', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16d7dc39-9477-5360-9d50-ad4ab5b9a212'}, {'abstract': 'Shakespeare’s “Henry VIII” chronicles Henry’s first divorce and remarriage, featuring no bloodshed but a coronation, two trials, an offstage execution, a royal christening and plenty of intrigue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/nyregion/a-review-of-henry-viii-at-the-f-m-kirby-shakespeare-theater-in-madison.html', 'snippet': 'Shakespeare’s “Henry VIII” chronicles Henry’s first divorce and remarriage, featuring no bloodshed but a coronation, two trials, an offstage execution, a royal christening and plenty of intrigue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Arriving on Broadway in the spring will be the Royal Shakespeare Company’s much-hailed “Wolf Hall: Parts 1 & 2,” Mike Poulton’s stage adaptation of Hilary Mantel’s two popular historical novels about dark doings at the court of King Henry VIII. The production will be presented in two parts and runs almost six hours. ', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 428}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1462, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26ARTSNJ1/26ARTSNJ1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pageantry and Sizzling Romance in ‘Henry VIII’', 'kicker': 'Theater Review | New Jersey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pageantry and Sizzling Romance in ‘Henry VIII’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons'