8e7f9ab7', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5813fc2-68c5-586d-a7ae-93038e7f9ab7'}, {'abstract': '“Wintersongs V: Forgotten Light” was part of the “Composer Portrait” of Chaya Czernowin at the Miller Theater at Columbia University.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/25/arts/music/chaya-czernowins-wintersongs-at-miller-theater.html', 'snippet': '“Wintersongs V: Forgotten Light” was part of the “Composer Portrait” of Chaya Czernowin at the Miller Theater at Columbia University.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Pick up a plastic comb.” So instructs the penultimate page of Chaya Czernowin’s “Wintersongs V: Forgotten Light,” which received its premiere during her entrancing Composer Portrait at the Miller Theater at Columbia University on Thursday. Each member of the piece’s two septets, one octet and two singers “thinks of a melody/pop song that they know and plays the rhythm of that melody” by scraping the comb’s teeth.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/CHAYA/CHAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/CHAYA/CHAYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/CHAYA/CHAYA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/CHAYA/CHAYA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1675, 'width': 1675, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/25/arts/CHAYA/CHAYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':