s knocked off course by a stroke.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My mother, Milli, is 87 and has been cheerfully planning her exit for years. Living will, executed power of attorney, key to the safe deposit box and the names of the lawyer, doctor and financial planner were sent to me decades ago, along with jolly “Death to me is just another adventure” missives. My name has been on her checking account for 20 years, so that I can start paying the bills before rigor mortis sets in, a Depression-era concern I have never been able to dispel.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1547, 'width': 1964, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/26/fashion/26MISINFORMED/26MISINFORMED-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur