ssing-candidate-of the-year award is Representative Michael Grimm, who is facing a federal indictment that, among other things, accuses him of cooking the books to avoid payroll taxes at a health food restaurant he ran in Manhattan. He was also caught on camera threatening to throw a NY1 reporter off a balcony in the United States Capitol. The Republican leadership in the House has tried hard to discourage Mr. Grimm from running, to no avail. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Congress in New York', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Congress in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Recchia, Domenic M Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maloney, Sean Patrick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eldridge, Sean', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endorsements', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grimm, Michael G', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hayworth, Nan', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gibson, Christopher P', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-25T01:50:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cccbb59-6d6e-5ee6-8904-86005639d9f6', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cccbb59-6d6e-5ee6-8904-86005639d9f6'}, {'abstract': 'Government forces fought for the third straight day to fend off a heavy assault by Islamic State militants on a strategically placed town in Anbar Province.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/25/world/middleeast/sunni-militants-draw-iraqi-forces-into-intense-battles-on-several-fronts.html', 'snippet': 'Government forces fought for the third straight day to fend off a heavy assault by Islamic State militants on a strategically placed town in Anbar Province.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — Iraqi government forces and allied Sunni tribal fighters on Friday fought for the third straight day to fend off a heavy assault by Islamic State militants on a strategically placed town in Anbar Province, officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunni Militants Draw Iraqi Forces Into Intense Battles on Several Fronts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sunni Militants Draw Iraqi Forces Into Intense Battles on Several Fronts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANBAR PROVINCE (IRAQ)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iraqi Army', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yazidi (Religious Sect)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-25T01:51:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'ny