is a spinoff of Le Bernardin, the celebrated restaurant, and is more casual than the mother ship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/nyregion/a-look-at-aldo-sohm-wine-bar.html', 'snippet': 'Aldo Sohm Wine Bar, seven weeks old, is a spinoff of Le Bernardin, the celebrated restaurant, and is more casual than the mother ship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aldo Sohm, a partner in the seven-week-old Le Bernardin spinoff that bears his name, surveyed the room on Tuesday evening — Keith Haring paintings on one wall, Grace Jones on the sound system — and sought the right metaphor for the pace of the night. “It’s like when you go to the dentist, and the dentist gives you painkillers, and all the sudden there’s no more difficulties,” he said in an Austrian accent that lingers after 10 years in New York. “There’s nothing to complain about. It’s just that the flow is different.”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26TABLE/26TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26TABLE/26TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 313}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26TABLE/26TABLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26TABLE/26TABLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1069, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/26/nyregion/26TABLE/26TABLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 