are desperately trying to sell oil abroad, even as the Iraqi government and the United States are blocking their attempts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/world/oil-gives-kurds-a-path-to-independence-and-conflict-with-baghdad.html', 'snippet': 'Kurdish officials are desperately trying to sell oil abroad, even as the Iraqi government and the United States are blocking their attempts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIRKUK, Iraq — Roughly two dozen huge oil tankers are idly turning figure eights around the Mediterranean or on the high seas, loaded with oil pumped from wells in Iraqi Kurdistan but with nowhere to legally offload it.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oil Gives Kurds a Path to Independence, and Conflict With Baghdad', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oil Gives Kurds a Path to Independence, and Conflict With Baghdad', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ahmed, Azam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Clifford', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kurds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kirkuk (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-25T23:17:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Azam Ahmed and Clifford Krauss', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Clifford', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krauss', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'typ