': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/45fef475-d912-56bd-92dd-0be08827da01', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45fef475-d912-56bd-92dd-0be08827da01'}, {'abstract': 'Ben C. Solomon has been making videos about the Ebola outbreak, finding scenes of courage even as people struggle to contain the disease.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/finding-visible-hope-amid-ebolas-invisible-danger/', 'snippet': 'Ben C. Solomon has been making videos about the Ebola outbreak, finding scenes of courage even as people struggle to contain the disease.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Video Journalist Ben C. Solomon has been covering the Ebola crisis in Sierra Leone and Liberia for The New York Times since August. Working with Sheri Fink, a New York Times reporter and a physician, and Daniel Berehulak, a photographer, he recently did a video on an American-run clinic in rural Liberia. Earlier this month, he documented an ambulance crew as it picked up sick patients — and dead bodies — in Monrovia. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Finding Visible Hope Amid Ebola’s Invisible Danger', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Liberia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monrovia (Liberia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sierra Leone', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-26T09:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b70121c-6740-5c85-9637-6cf8f90bfea2', 'word_count': 786, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b70121c-6740-5c85-9637-6cf8f90bfea2'}, {'abstract': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Neville Chamberlain blames Ribbentrop for choosing war over peace in 1939.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/26/1939-ribbentrop-will-bear-guilt-for-tragedy-of-war-neville-chamberlain-says/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: Neville Chamberlain blames Ribbentrop for choosing war over peace in 1939.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Germany has chosen the war to which Britain has pledged itself, instead of the peace Britain was willing to give, and when that decision is implemented, the Nazi state will battle against the entire moral and material resources of the empire and will bear sole responsibility for the conflict and its consequences, Prime Minister Neville Chamberlain told the House of Commons today [Oct. 26].', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '1939: Ribbentrop Will Bear Guilt for Tragedy of War, Neville Chamberlain Says', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chamberlain, Neville', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-26T10:17:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By International Herald Tribune', 'person': [{'firstname': 'International', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d94df427-8415-5b79-a218-8948ae8450a7', 'word_count': 157, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d94df427-8415-5b79-a218-8948ae8450a7'}, {'abstract': 'The cancellation of the balloting, which had been intended as a display of unity, exposed tensions over how to sustain the protests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/world/asia/pro-democracy-movements-vote-in-hong-kong-abruptly-called-off.html', 'snippet': 'The cancellation of the balloting, which had been intended as a display of unity, exposed tensions over how to sustain the protests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Organizers of a planned vote among Hong Kong’s pro-democracy demonstrators abruptly canceled it on Sunday, exposing tensions and confusion over how to sustain the movement a month after protesters occupied major streets to demand free elections.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pro-Democracy Movement’s Vote in Hong Kong Abruptly Called Off', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hong Kong', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Central', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hong Kong Federation of Students', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tai Yiu-ting, Benny', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-26T10:50:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley and Alan Wong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname'