 home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/nyregion/ebola-quarantine.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said that people quarantined in New York who do not show symptoms of the disease would be allowed to remain at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Facing fierce resistance from the White House and medical experts to a strict new mandatory quarantine policy, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said on Sunday night that medical workers who had contact with Ebola patients in West Africa but did not show symptoms of the disease would be allowed to remain at home and would receive compensation for lost income.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Under Pressure, Cuomo Says Ebola Quarantines Can Be Spent at Home', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Under Pressure, Cuomo Says Ebola Quarantines Can Be Spent at Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hickox, Kaci', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-26T15:02:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer, Michael D. Shear and Michael Barbaro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt: