 of all British operations in the country, as the Afghan Army assumed full control of the bases in Helmand Province.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/world/asia/us-and-british-troops-end-combat-operations-in-key-afghan-province.html', 'snippet': 'The handover signified the end of all British operations in the country, as the Afghan Army assumed full control of the bases in Helmand Province.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Combat operations in Helmand Province officially ended on Sunday for the United States Marines and British troops stationed there, bringing an end to a decade-long struggle to keep a major Taliban stronghold and the region’s vast opium production in check.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/27AFGHANISTAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/27/world/27AFGHANISTAN/27AFGHANISTAN-thumb