7d23ff0', 'word_count': 755, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2e0395c-a7a1-5c42-b8bc-12ca17d23ff0'}, {'abstract': 'The recent ouster of Ted Bishop, the P.G.A. of America president, over comments labeling Ian Poulter a “little girl” revealed how deeply ingrained sexism remains in golf.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/sports/golf/golfing-like-a-girl-its-about-time.html', 'snippet': 'The recent ouster of Ted Bishop, the P.G.A. of America president, over comments labeling Ian Poulter a “little girl” revealed how deeply ingrained sexism remains in golf.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All you need to know about golf in the 21st century is that Lucy Li and Ted Bishop were two of 2014’s biggest newsmakers in the sport. At 11, Li became the youngest qualifier, male or female, to compete in this country’s showcase event and acquitted herself honorably on the same Pinehurst No. 2 course that the week before had chewed up and spit out the likes of the men’s major winners Bubba Watson and Jason Dufner.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/sports/CROUSE1/CROUSE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Playing Like a Girl? It’s About Time', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Playing Like a Girl? It’s About Time', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bishop, Ted', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ladies Professional Golf Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Professional Golfers Assn', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Li, Lucy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poulter, Ian', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-26T22:09:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d358224d-3926-5e30-841a-8b81b8f95a06', 'word_count': 932, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d358224d-3926-5e30-841a-8b81b8f95a06'}, {'abstract': 'Twitter w