t': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/d89c5d9e-c516-5a9e-9c87-254bf48e423f'}, {'abstract': 'The Christie administration is flouting news media and watchdog organizations’ requests for public records.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/opinion/chris-christies-battle-against-transparency.html', 'snippet': 'The Christie administration is flouting news media and watchdog organizations’ requests for public records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN his very first promise as governor of New Jersey, Chris Christie pledged on Inauguration Day in 2010 to shine daylight on the workings of his government. “Today a new era of accountability and transparency is here,” Mr. Christie said. “Today, I will sign executive orders that will make our finances, our budgeting and our processes more transparent for all citizens to see. Today, change has arrived.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Secrets of New Jersey', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Secrets of New Jersey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Laura R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Archives and Records', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WNYC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Information Act', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-27T00:14:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline