playing by himself” or let him be?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/weekly-quandary-does-the-introverted-preschooler-need-work/', 'snippet': 'Should a reader help her child “work” on taking pleasure in being with others as well as “exploring/playing by himself” or let him be?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Weekly Quandary, we pull from the comments, the weekly open thread or email a question that we know (or at least suspect) plagues more than one parent. You — the readers — provide the advice: How have you resolved this (or not) in your family? This week’s quandary came from a comment from the reader SN, that I suspect was meant for the Open Thread, but posted on the satirical essay Turn Your Princess-Obsessed Toddler Into a Feminist in Eight Easy Steps:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/us/motherlode-introvert/motherlode-introvert-jumbo.png', 'height': 316, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/us/motherlode-introvert/motherlode-introvert-superJumbo.png', 'height': 316, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/us/motherlode-introvert/motherlode-introvert-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/27/us/motherlode-introvert/motherlode-introvert-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/27/us/motherlode-introvert/motherlode-introvert-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarg