2-521f-846e-95a7ffa3a526', 'word_count': 38, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ac88673-d3a2-521f-846e-95a7ffa3a526'}, {'abstract': 'Time, writes Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews, can work against mergers just as it does perishable produce.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/27/chiquita-shareholders-choose-the-safer-option/', 'snippet': 'Time, writes Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews, can work against mergers just as it does perishable produce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chiquita shareholders got yellow and chose green. They voted down a stock deal to acquire Irish produce distributor Fyffes, a decision that led Chiquita to agree on Monday to sell to Brazilian buyers for about $680 million in cash instead. Ailing arbitrageurs, a revolt against tax-driven mergers and global economic ructions all led to the path of least uncertainty.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-chiquita2/dbpix-chiquita2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-chiquita2/dbpix-chiquita2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-chiquita2/dbpix-chiquita2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 756, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-chiquita2/dbpix-chiquita2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1230, 'width': 1665, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-chiquita2/dbpix-chiquita2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7