 a sequel so much as a rueful epilogue, a brief account of her own recent skirmish with heart disease.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/health/martha-weinman-lear-returns-to-medical-memoir-with-less-fury-in-echoes-of-heartsounds.html', 'snippet': 'Martha Weinman Lear returns to the territory she covered in “Heartsounds,” but this is not a sequel so much as a rueful epilogue, a brief account of her own recent skirmish with heart disease.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to medical memoir, Martha Weinman Lear literally wrote the book — her devastating, widely acclaimed “Heartsounds” was published in 1979, well before frank public discussions of illness and health care became routine. The story of her first husband’s slow death from intractable heart disease set a bar for the genre so high that few of the thousands of similar books published since have come close to duplicating its power.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/science/28SCIB/28SCIB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 913, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/28/science/28SCIB/28SCIB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 913}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/science/28SCIB/28SCIB-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 673, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/science/28SCIB/28SCIB-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1346, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/science/28SCIB/28SCIB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height