estor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CDK Global has been a publicly traded company for roughly a month. But the company, a former unit of Automatic Data Processing, has already drawn the attention of an activist hedge fund.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-articleLarge.png', 'height': 737, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 737}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 834, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1265, 'width': 1030, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/28/business/dbpix-cdk-global/dbpix-cdk-global-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Activist Hedge Fund Takes Stake in Former A.D.P. Unit', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drawing Interest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CDK Global Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major