tle over the State Senate into one of the most expensive legislative elections in state history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/us/trying-to-raise-profile-of-climate-change-for-washington-voters.html', 'snippet': 'The effort, by Thomas F. Steyer, has turned the battle over the State Senate into one of the most expensive legislative elections in state history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — The effort by a California billionaire named Thomas F. Steyer to bolster global climate change measures in Washington has turned the battle over the State Senate into one of the most expensive legislative elections in state history.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1543, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/28/us/CLIMATE/CLIMATE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image