feats of management, has seized on a largely unfamiliar role: the coolheaded executive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/nyregion/with-ebolas-arrival-de-blasio-stands-tall-as-christie-and-cuomo-falter.html', 'snippet': 'With a spotlight trained on City Hall, Mayor Bill de Blasio, known more for flights of rhetoric than feats of management, has seized on a largely unfamiliar role: the coolheaded executive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The arrival of Ebola in New York City has prompted a fractious showdown between federal and state officials over quarantine policies. Health experts have accused Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo and his New Jersey counterpart, Chris Christie, of fear-mongering and victim blaming. Mr. Christie stumbled into a war of words with a nurse his state held in isolation until Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/28/nyregion/28MAYOR/y-MAYOR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'De Blasio Takes a Businesslike Approach as Ebola Arrives in New York', 'kicker': 'Political Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'De Blasio Takes a Businesslike Approach as Ebola Arrives in New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ebola Virus', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spencer, Craig Allen (1981- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Epidemics', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T01:31:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer and Michael M. Grynbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/98e8711f-3f49-5b2f-8c7f-2f854180c73d', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/98e8711f-3f49-5b2f-8c7f-2f854180c73d'}, {'abstract': 'The government of Prime Minister Stephen Harper introduced an antiterrorism bill on Monday that was to have been brought before lawmakers the day a gunman stormed Parliament.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/world/americas/canada-terrorism-bill-unveiled.html', 'snippet': 'The government of Prime Minister Stephen Harper introduced an antiterrorism bill on Monday that was to have been brought before lawmakers the day a gunman stormed Parliament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The government of Prime Minister Stephen Harper introduced an anti-terrorism bill on Monday that was to have been brought before lawmakers last Wednesday — the day a gunman killed a soldier at a war memorial in Ottawa and then stormed the Parliament Buildings. Among other things, the bill explicitly approves the practice of sharing information about Canadian terrorist suspects gathered by foreign intelligence services with Canada’s spy agency and increases secrecy surrounding informants. Separately, Commissioner Robert Paulson of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police said that the gunman, Michael Zehaf-Bibeau, appeared “quite lucid and quite purposeful” in a video he recorded, but apparently did not distribute, before the attack. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Canada: Terrorism Bill Unveiled', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Canada: Terrorism Bill Unveiled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zehaf-Bibeau, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T01:32:46+00