 spare. And don’t be late for meetings and events (there’s a fine for that).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/02/education/edlife/greek-letters-at-a-price.html', 'snippet': 'Looking to join a sorority? You’ll need time and money to spare. And don’t be late for meetings and events (there’s a fine for that).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine finding a bill for $200 in your mailbox because your daughter was late to a couple of sorority events. Imagine, too, that those who snitched were her new best friends. This is one of the unwelcome surprises of sorority membership.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/112-SORORITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/112-SORORITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/112-SORORITY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/112-SORORITY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/1102-SORORITY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/02/education/edlife/1102-SORORITY/1102-SORORITY-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei