abstract': 'Mr. Cantlie, a photojournalist abducted two years ago, is depicted as saying that the battle for the town on the Turkey-Syria border is “nearly over.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/29/world/middleeast/john-cantlie-british-hostage-said-to-appear-in-isis-video-from-kobani.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Cantlie, a photojournalist abducted two years ago, is depicted as saying that the battle for the town on the Turkey-Syria border is “nearly over.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A British hostage of the Islamic State has been shown in a video, apparently made in the beleaguered Syrian town of Kobani near the Turkish border, depicting him as a combat correspondent and forecasting that the town is about to fall to militants despite waves of American airstrikes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'John Cantlie, British Hostage, Seen in ISIS Video Apparently From Kobani', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'John Cantlie, British Hostage, Seen in ISIS Video Apparently From Kobani', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping and Hostages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic State in Iraq and Syria (ISIS)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cantlie, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kobani (Syria)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T10:11:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48fbba8b-dea2-5dbd-a000-7ec2c2949293', 'word_count': 683, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48fbba8b-dea2-5dbd-a000-7ec2c2949293'}, {'abstract': 'The weak results at the Russian state-owned company Rosneft, in which BP holds a 20 percent stake, also contributed to the third-quarter decline.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/29/business/international/bp-earnings-q3.html', 'snippet': 'The weak results at the Russian state-owned company Rosneft, in which BP holds a 20 percent stake, also contributed to the third-quarter decline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — BP said on Tuesday that earnings for the third quarter fell about 18 percent on lower oil prices and declining profit from its stake in Rosneft, the Russian state oil company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'BP Earnings Fall 18% on Lower Oil Prices', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prices Low, BP Profit Drops 18%', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BP Plc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rosneft', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BG Group Plc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T10:20:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stanley Reed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stanley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b79dcaf-b832-5073-8a36-16c4d31c759e'