e actress sings the number “Barf Bag Breakup” from the new musical “Found,” based on found writings and anonymous notes.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/in-performance-barrett-wilbert-weed-of-found/', 'snippet': 'The actress sings the number “Barf Bag Breakup” from the new musical “Found,” based on found writings and anonymous notes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s video features the actress Barrett Wilbert Weed singing the number “Barf Bag Breakup” from “Found,” a new musical with a book by Hunter Bell and Lee Overtree and music and lyrics by Eli Bolin. The show, based on the magazine of the same name, sets to music handwritten letters, anonymous scribblings and other “found” notes.” In this number, a note to a lover begins: “I think this is it for us.” “Found,” which was directed by Mr. Overtree, continues through Nov. 9 at the Atlantic Theater Company’s Linda Gross Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Barrett Wilbert Weed of ‘Found’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weed, Barrett Wilbert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlantic Theater Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T12:00:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cae3fdb2-4c11-50f9-8c92-2f9f1b7d4531', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cae3fdb2-4c11-50f9-8c92-2f9f1b7d4531'}, {'abstract': 'Mark L