4.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/1964-u-s-backs-britain-on-rhodesia/', 'snippet': 'Highlights from the International Herald Tribune archives: The U.S. opposes Rhodesia’s efforts for independence in 1964.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The United States gave unqualified support to Britain today in opposing any move by the white government of Southern Rhodesia toward a unilateral declaration of independence. The State Department, saying that ‘‘the U.S. government has followed the course of events in Rhodesia with intense interest and mounting concern,’’ called for a solution ‘‘acceptable to the majority of the people.’’ It warned the Rhodesians of ‘‘serious consequences which would befall all Rhodesia should their government continue to follow its present course.’’\xa0— New York Herald Tribune, European Edition, Oct. 27, 1964', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/blogs/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 445, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/blogs/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 445, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/blogs/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/29/blogs/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia/29iht-oldoct29-rhodesia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/