', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'Associated Press', 'person': [], 'organization': 'Associated Press'}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/cb6f75a9-a8e1-59f5-bf0f-42454175c6df', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/cb6f75a9-a8e1-59f5-bf0f-42454175c6df'}, {'abstract': 'Two years after the storm, Times readers affected by it share some of what they learned.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/28/lessons-learned-from-hurricane-sandy/', 'snippet': 'Two years after the storm, Times readers affected by it share some of what they learned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many residents of the New York area who were affected by Hurricane Sandy, the process of recovery continues two years later as the city rebuilds. The New York Times asked readers this month to share their stories, highlighting any lessons they learned in the aftermath of the storm. We wanted to know what they would do differently and what advice they had for others. Here is a selection of excerpts from their responses:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lessons Learned From Hurricane Sandy', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York Metropolitan Area', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-28T23:57:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e24cc35-56e8-5e36-abda-1a592bdabd44', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e24cc35-56e8-5e36-abda-1a592bdabd44'}, {'abstract': 'When The Times asked readers affected by Hurricane Sandy to report how they were doing two years later, many wrote of the primacy of their loved ones.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/29/nyregion/stronger-family-bonds-two-years-after-hurricane-sandy.html', 'snippet': 'When The Times asked readers affected by Hurricane Sandy to report how they were doing two years later, many wrote of the primacy of their loved ones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago this week, Hurricane Sandy ripped through the region, forcing thousands of residents of New York and New Jersey out of their homes with wind, flood and fire. The New York Times asked readers who were affected to describe their lives today, and we were struck by how many responses emphasized the role of family in their resilience to the storm. Here is a selection of those responses, edited for length and clarity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/nyregion/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/29/nyregion/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/nyregion/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/nyregion/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC/sandyanniversary_ss-slide-LMDC-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2