 Syrian refugee widows and families who lost husbands fighting the Assad government. About a dozen of these buildings have sprung up near the Syrian border, a testament to the almost 200,000 lives lost in the conflict.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Poverty and Uncertainty for Widows of Syrian ‘Freedom Fighters’', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Widows and Widowers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jordan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-29T09:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a8c43a78-bfa6-5f47-9c01-2c486dd131d5', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8c43a78-bfa6-5f47-9c01-2c486dd131d5'}, {'abstract': 'What are your thoughts about cosmetic surgery in general? Why do you think people seemed to care so much about how Renée Zellweger looks?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/29/what-are-your-opinions-on-cosmetic-surgery/', 'snippet': 'What are your thoughts about cosmetic surgery in general? Why do you think people seemed to care so much about how Renée Zellweger looks?', 'lead_paragraph'