day, casting ballots in a parliamentary election that many are calling a milestone —\xa0a step from the country’s muddled political past into a West-oriented future. At the same time, however, words of caution are plenty, with observers both within and outside of Ukraine anxiously looking at the protracted conflict in the east, the government’s empty coffers and the corruption-prone political and legal systems in urgent need of reform.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 594}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1015, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1935, 'width': 1953, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/opinion/nyto-ukraine/nyto-ukraine-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLa