ealthy enough to play lined up against a team of alumni in a game of flag football.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1502, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/29/sports/30FOOTBALL-hp/30FOOTBALL-hp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Injury Lists Grow Longer, and High School Seasons Are Cut Short', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Injury Lists Grow Longer, and Seasons Are Cut Short', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'F