artly, Lincoln Center promises, to discuss how they have been influenced by each other’s work, and partly to preside over performances of their music (Jan. 31).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 795}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 773, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1137, 'width': 858, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/arts/arts2/arts2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sondheim Meets Reich at Lincoln Center’s American Songbook Series', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sondheim Meets Reich In Songbook Series', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Songbook (Music Series)', 'rank': 1, 'major': '