e}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e5b0f45-5613-5f99-bc48-0503b98ab57e', 'word_count': 749, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e5b0f45-5613-5f99-bc48-0503b98ab57e'}, {'abstract': 'A whitewashed brownstone in Harlem, where the rooms have names and the chai is brewed to perfection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/30/greathomesanddestinations/a-harlem-brownstone-is-renovated-to-make-room-for-tea.html', 'snippet': 'A whitewashed brownstone in Harlem, where the rooms have names and the chai is brewed to perfection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It all started with a cup of chai. Or the desire for one, at least.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Heaven Is Down the Hall', 'kicker': 'On Location', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Heaven Is Down the Hall', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Louie, Elaine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trehan, Anita', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chaiwali (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-29T22:46:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Great Homes & Destinations', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Louie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Louie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5c0e238-909b-5bea-800d-c9459f7ed870', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5c0e238-909b-5bea-800d-c9459f7ed870'}, {'abstract': 'An exhibition dedicated to contemporary Latin American design, craft and art opens in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/30/garden/new-territories-brings-latin-american-ingenuity-to-the-museum-of-arts-and-design.html', 'snippet': 'An exhibition dedicated to contemporary Latin American design, craft and art opens in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, the Museum of Arts and Design in New York will open an exhibition dedicated to contemporary Latin American design. The work of this new generation of artists is tied together by an ingenious use of “upcycled” materials that reinterpret the “detritus of technology to make it beautiful,” said the curator, Lowery Sims. Many pieces in the show “wouldn’t be possible without reused PET plastic water bottles.” (They were stripped into weaving materials, for example, for a light fixture, top, by the Spanish artist Alvaro Catalán de Ocón.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/garden/30CURR3-5COMBO/30CURR3-5COMBO-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 279, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/30/garden/30CURR3-5COMBO/30CURR3-5COMBO-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 279}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/garden/30CURR3-5COMBO/30CURR3-5COMBO-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/garden/30CURR3-5COMBO/30CURR3-5COMBO-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 953, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None