ages of crime and accident scenes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/movies/nightcrawler-stars-jake-gyllenhaal-as-an-obsessive.html', 'snippet': 'In “Nightcrawler,” Jake Gyllenhaal plays a freelance videographer who tries to corner the market on grisly images of crime and accident scenes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lou Bloom, the title character of “Nightcrawler,” is a youngish man who possesses a strong work ethic, tireless curiosity and very little in the way of conscience or human feeling. Played with a precise repertoire of tics by Jake Gyllenhaal, Lou usually smiles when he speaks, but that seems more like learned behavior than genuine friendliness, since he is too literal-minded to understand jokes or social cues. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1209, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31night/31night-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '