dlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lehman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca4475bf-30fa-54cd-8efb-4c08b4edbd13', 'word_count': 1006, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca4475bf-30fa-54cd-8efb-4c08b4edbd13'}, {'abstract': 'A recalibration of the Matty Scores to take unearned runs into account makes Madison Bumgarner’s performance look even more remarkable.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/upshot/madison-bumgarner-earning-his-place-in-history.html', 'snippet': 'A recalibration of the Matty Scores to take unearned runs into account makes Madison Bumgarner’s performance look even more remarkable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was working for Business Week magazine in Chicago in the late 1990s, I used to print out articles from the web and bring them to a deli to read over lunch. There were no smartphones or iPhones yet, and the web was full of fabulous writing that I wanted to read. My most frequent lunchtime companion — virtually speaking — was Rob Neyer, then a baseball writer for ESPN.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/upshot/31UP-Unearned/31UP-Unearned-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/31/upshot/31UP-Unearned/31UP-Unearned-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/upshot/31UP-Unearned/31UP-Unearned-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/upshot/31UP-Unearned/31UP-Unearned-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType'