l': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/10/30/british-pub-operator-extends-deadline-for-takeover-bid/', 'snippet': 'Greene King has offered to acquire the Spirit Pub Company for about $1.2 billion in cash and stock. It now has until Nov. 4 to make a final offer under British takeover rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – The Spirit Pub Company of Britain has agreed to give Greene King, a British brewer and operator of pubs and hotels, more time to make a final takeover offer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British Pub Operator Extends Deadline for Takeover Bid', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deadline Extension', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-30T14:59:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aa0818b9-fda6-5aae-bbbc-d4a116dd290f', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aa0818b9-fda6-5aae-bbbc-d4a116dd290f'}, {'abstract': 'The Big Data era of politics has left some campaigns drowning in their own sophisticated advances, unable to produce new and effective messages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/us/politics/data-driven-campaigns-zero-in-on-voters-but-messages-are-lacking.html', 'snippet': 'The Big Data era of politics has left some campaigns drowning in their own sophisticated advances, unable to produce new and effective messages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Modern political campaigns home in on their key voters with drone-like precision, down to the smallest niche — like Prius-driving single women in Northern Virginia who care about energy issues. They compile hundreds of pieces of data on individuals, from party registration to pet ownership to favorite TV shows. And they can reach people through Facebook, Pandora, Twitter, YouTube or cable television.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/us/DATA/DATA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Data-Driven Campaigns Zero In on Voters, but Messages Are Lacking', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Data-Dr