 video of a woman being repeatedly catcalled went viral, she received a stream of online abuse that, many noted, mirrored what she experienced offline.', 'web_url': 'https://op-talk.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/30/when-street-harassment-continues-online/', 'snippet': 'After a video of a woman being repeatedly catcalled went viral, she received a stream of online abuse that, many noted, mirrored what she experienced offline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A\xa0video of the catcalls one woman received walking around New York\xa0has incited\xa0a larger discussion about street harassment. And many see a\xa0disturbing parallel\xa0in the harassment that woman experienced when the video went online.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 598, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 598}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/30/blogs/30HARRASMENT/30HARRASMENT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank