Chinese jars and other fragments of history, the master restorer Bouke de Vries now creates something wholly original from them.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/30/bouke-de-vries-interview/', 'snippet': 'No longer content to simply mend ceramic plates, Chinese jars and other fragments of history, the master restorer Bouke de Vries now creates something wholly original from them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tall, broad, with a trim beard, Bouke de Vries scarcely looks the scholarly sort who would spend his days obsessing over fragments of delicate porcelain or composing fragile memento mori under bell jars.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '98', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/t-magazine/02travel-arena-bouke-1/02travel-arena-bouke-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/02/t-magazine/02travel-arena-bouke-1/02travel-arena-bouke-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/t-magazine/02travel-arena-bouke-1/02travel-arena-bouke-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/t-magazine/02travel-arena-bouke-1/02travel-arena-bouke-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 975, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/t-magazine/02travel-arena-bouke-1/02travel-arena-bouke-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20