sor dropped, trapping it inside my helmet, shrilling and biting? What if I went off the road and snapped my back and was left paralyzed, out of sight down the embankment, with a dying bat in my helmet, its wings shattered, its claws scrabbling, the little white staples of its teeth sinking into me?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-jumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-draft/opinionator-pog-draft-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType'