'}, {'abstract': 'A comparison of prices from a 1964 newspaper ad and from the same supermarket chain today yields some interesting results.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/upshot/halloween-candy-has-gotten-cheaper.html', 'snippet': 'A comparison of prices from a 1964 newspaper ad and from the same supermarket chain today yields some interesting results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times has converted all of its 1964 issues into a digitized, searchable format. Each week, The Upshot will unearth an item from 50 years ago and put it in the light of today. The ad titled “Happy Halloween’s Start at Waldbaum’s” appeared on Page 40 of the Oct. 28 issue and can be seen in its original format on TimesMachine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/upshot/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/30/upshot/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 595}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/upshot/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1015, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/upshot/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 1400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/30/upshot/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO/31UP-Archive-Dive-slide-CUCO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7