 effortlessly between high and low, among cultures, ricocheting off different racial stereotypes and religious beliefs. His paintings mesmerize, whether with their opulent dotted surfaces or bawdy eroticism, their perfumed colors or their riffs on established masterpieces.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Medium and Message, Both Unsettling', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Medium and Message, Both Unsettling', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Museum of Contemporary Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ofili, Chris', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-30T21:42:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roberta Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roberta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/13375933-1bc2-52f2-9f62-44d9a7df1543', 'word_count': 1344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13375933-1bc2-52f2-9f62-44d9a7df1543'}, {'abstract': 'BalletCollective, a small company of dancers from City Ballet trying a fresh approach to choreography, presented two world premieres at the Skirball Center this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/arts/dance/balletcollective-performs-at-the-skirball-center.html', 'snippet': 'BalletCollective, a small company of dancers from City Ballet trying a fresh approach to choreography, presented two world premieres at the Skirball Center this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The worlds created by BalletCollective  are mint-fresh. They feel both attuned to life outside the performing arts and to the interior lives of the performers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/COLLECTIVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/COLLECTIVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/COLLECTIVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/COLLECTIVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/31COLLECTIVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/31COLLECTIVE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/10/31/arts/31COLLECTIVE/31COLLECTIVE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leaping From Within, Narratives of a Young Ensemble', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leaping From 