. For nine years, by way of YouTube clips, word of mouth and a DVD set available on Amazon for a reasonable $7.45, the popularity of “The Comeback” only continued to build.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 790, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 790}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 778, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1555, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/arts/02KUDROW1/02KUDROW1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'She’s Still There for Her ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'She’s Still There for Her', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major':