erves.html', 'snippet': 'International talks in Australia on establishing two marine reserve areas, each larger than Texas, in the waters around Antarctica ended in failure on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYDNEY, Australia — International talks in Australia on establishing two marine reserve areas, each larger than Texas, in the waters around Antarctica ended in failure on Friday, with some delegates to the negotiations saying that China and Russia had resisted the proposals.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China and Russia Said to Block Creation of Antarctic Marine Reserves', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Delegates Fail to Agree on Creation of Marine Reserves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANTARCTIC REGIONS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Innis, Michelle', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish and Other Marine Life', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oceans and Seas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commission for the Conservation of Antarctic Marine Living Resources', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-31T13:37:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michelle Innis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michelle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Innis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ec748a9-060e-5d65-8fc1-48447857ffd9', 'word_count': 545, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ec748a9-060e-5d65-8fc1-48447857ffd9'}, {'abstract': 'Clive James, 75, who has leukemia, continues to publish poetry and work on other projects in a career that has defied definition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/01/world/europe/prolific-writer-clive-james-facing-death-reflects-on-getting-a-few-things-done.html', 'snippet': 'Clive James, 75, who has leukemia, continues to publish poetry and work on other projects in a career that has defied definition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — CLIVE JAMES is dying, but he’s pretty good-natured about it. A man who found his way from a poor, sewer-free suburb of Sydney, Australia, to become a beloved writer, entertainer and figure in British life, he can look back with astonishment and amusement, and look forward with a trenchant eye.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1367, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/world/01james-sub/01james-sub