}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c182a024-13a4-57e7-b90a-832365bd65a5', 'word_count': 715, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c182a024-13a4-57e7-b90a-832365bd65a5'}, {'abstract': 'The 49-year-old fighter is known for using his mental acumen to weaken, and eventually defeat, his opponents in the ring.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/02/magazine/bernard-hopkins-boxings-oldest-and-most-cunning-champion.html', 'snippet': 'The 49-year-old fighter is known for using his mental acumen to weaken, and eventually defeat, his opponents in the ring.', 'lead_paragraph': '“There’s a god of this world,” Bernard Hopkins was saying. “Some say the mass media is the god of this world. It’s like a song, like that ‘Happy.’ They shoved it down my throat. At first I hated it. Why I got to be happy? My dog died! But it ended up being one of my favorite songs. They put one of those songs out every 20 years. No matter how bad your life is, no matter how legitimate your reasons for being upset, they say, ‘Don’t worry, be happy.’ Song’s only three minutes, then you stop being happy. The way they control human beings, like cattle. How do a sheepdog keep 50 or 100 sheeps in order? I’m watching a dog keep a herd on TV, and I’m thinking that’s the way the system got most human beings: ‘Eat this. Drink that.’ ”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/mag-02Hopkins-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/mag-02Hopkins-t_CA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/mag-02Hopkins-t_CA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/mag-02Hopkins-t_CA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/02hopkins2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/02hopkins2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/02/magazine/02hopkins2/02hopkins2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernard Hopkins, Boxing’s Oldest – and Most Cunning – Champion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leading With His Head', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rotella, Carlo', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hopkins, Bernard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boxing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Boxing Hall of Fame', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-31T14:30:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carlo Rotella', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carlo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rotella', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c1fa010-b4b5-5