{'abstract': 'The Jewish Museum’s new exhibition, “Beauty is Power,” explores the life and taste of the woman from a Polish shtetl who went on to radically alter the beauty industry.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/10/31/helena-rubinstein-jewish-museum/', 'snippet': 'The Jewish Museum’s new exhibition, “Beauty is Power,” explores the life and taste of the woman from a Polish shtetl who went on to radically alter the beauty industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In many ways, the beauty magnate, philanthropist and style icon Helena Rubinstein set the bar for the modern career woman. A contemporary of Coco Chanel, whom she often tapped for fittings and custom designs, Rubinstein was part of a wave of 20th-century entrepreneurs who encouraged women to take control of their destinies through carefully curated self-invention. With the first major retrospective of her life, “Beauty Is Power,”\xa0opening today at the Jewish Museum, the immigrant from a Polish shtetl who went on to radically alter the beauty industry will finally receive the closer look she deserves.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Helena Rubinstein, Icon of Business and Style, Gets Her Own Retrospective', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty (Concept)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rubinstein, Helena', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jewish Museum (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Krakow (Poland)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-10-31T18:31:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Feinstein', 'person